<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Shanjo</book>
  <para style="h">Maleka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Male</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maleka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ibuka lya Maleka</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ibuka lya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Maleka</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Joani aa sukulula byo keza kwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Joa 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Aga ngo matatikilo go majwi a malotu ga Jesu uju ka li Mushaligwa no Mwana Nyambe. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Se ku tatika uku tendaala ku ja ko bu sa ñolela u muboni gwa Nyambe Isaya aa sa ñola buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 1:2" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Kuti na ndi tume jumwinya buti na li tangize tanzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">keza ku sukulwila a bantu byo keza ko Mfumu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Malaki 3:1</ref>.</char></note>”<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />“Ijwi lyo ju a kugiliza mu mangusu li ta buti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Mu shabule inzila jo Mfumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">Mu mu golwele a mazila.’ ”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isaya 40:3</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Jojo u muntu sa tumigwa ka li Joani, uju ka joja mu mangusu na tandaza a bantu buti ba kolobezigwe no ku sigulukila kwa Nyambe ku zwa ku bitendantu i bimangoju byabo buti Nyambe a ba kwatile. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />A bantu bonse ba mwilonga lya Judeya no ba mu munzi gwa Jelusalema, ka ba keza kwakwe. Mi aa ka ba li lugula i bitendantu i bimangoju byabo, Joani ka ba kolobeza mu Lwizi lwa Joodani. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />I bizwato bya Joani ka bi li byo ku suma a boja bo cipagu ci kugigwa inkamele, mi u lukaku ka li shuminanga ka lu li lo ku suka a mukumba. I bilyo byakwe ibi ka joja, ka bi li buci ne zige.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Izige, mushobo go bimpansi ibi bi gulukanga mu bipani i binene. Mi bya sa jonanga i bimenantu no mani go bishamu na bi lya ku mana.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Joani ka tandaza a bantu na ba ta buti, “Nkwali uju a keza mwishule lyangu uju a ndi ita ku nguzu, buti mane neme ta ndi goli uku kotama no ku shumununa u tushuminiso to nshangu jakwe. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Ime mbulyo ndi mi kolobeza ko menzi kono ige kuti na mi kolobeze ko Moya go Kucena.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joani aa kolobeza Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Mat 3:13–4:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Momo mu majuba, Jesu kale ga zwa mu munzi gwa Nanzaleta gwa mwilonga lya Galileya, mi Joani kale ga mu kolobeza mu Lwizi lwa Joodani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Jesu aa bomboka ku zwa mu menzi, kale ga bona igulu li galuka mi kale ga bona u Moya go Kucena gu zwa kwigulu na gu mu sezumukila na gu bonaala sinagwe nu nziba. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Kale kwa shugwaala ijwi li zwa kwigulu li ta buti, “Ndigwe Mwanangu mi ndi la ku shaka lwini mi u la ndi jangaza.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Jesu aa sa la mani uku kolobezigwa, u Moya go Kucena kale gwa mu twala mu mangusu. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Kale ga ka kalamo a majuba go makumi gone na jelekigwa kwa Satani. Mukati ko bipagu ka joja kono a mañiloi ka ga mu unela.<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus tempted in the wilderness" file="wa03812b.jpg" size="col" loc="Mrk 1:12-13" ref="1:12-13">Jesu aa jelekigwa mu mangusu</figure><verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa tatika uku tandaza a bantu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Mat 4:12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Joani aa sa la tuligwa mu ntolongo, Jesu kale ga ja mwilonga lya Galileya, na ja bu tandaza a majwi a malotu ga Nyambe. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Kale ga ja bu tandaza nage, “I nako na ja sika mi u mubuso gwa Nyambe se gu li li afuwi. Mu sigulukile kwakwe mi mu leke i bitendantu i bimangoju byenu, mi mu zumine a majwi gakwe a malotu!”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa shala a bazigigwa bakwe bone betanzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Ijuba limwinya, Jesu aa ka itile kumbali ne kamba lyeziba inene lya Galileya, kale ga bona Simoni no mwancegwe Andileya na ba yamba, kakuli ka ba li mandui. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Jesu kale ga ta nage, “Mu keze mu ndi umpilile mi kuti na ndi mi tume buti mu ka yambe a bantu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Aobulyo kale ba leka u tunyandi twabo no ku mu umpilila.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Jesu aa zwao, kale ga bona Jakobo mwana Zebedeya na kele no mwancegwe Joani mu bwato na ba shumagila u tunyandi twabo. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Aobulyo, kale ga ba kuga mi kale ba leka isabo Zebedeya no babeleki babo mu bwato, mi kale ba mu umpilila.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa tanda u moya u mubi ku nkosi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luk 4:31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Jesu no bazigigwa bakwe kale ba ja mu munzi gwa Kapenauma, mi ijuba lyo Nsabata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ijuba lyo bu 7 mu nsunda, ili ta ka ba sebezanga a Majuda na ba lapela Nyambe mi mu Cishanjo ndya Mukibelo kampa ijuba lyo ku wisa.</char></note> ili na lya nungako, Jesu kale ga ja no ka ngina mu njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Injugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda, ni njugo umu ka ba gwananinanga a Majuda, ku bala a mabuka ga Mushe no ku kumbila i bintu kwa Nyambe. Mu Cigelike ka ba ji kuganga i cinagoge.</char></note> Kale ga tatika uku ziga ijwi lya Nyambe ku bantu. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Kale ba komokwa lwini ko bu ka gambila kakuli kame ka ziga ko nguzu iji ta ka ba bonanga ku bazigi bo mulao. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Aobulyo unkosi uju ka munitwe ku moya u mubi kale ga ngina momo mu njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda no ku kugiliza lwini nage, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />“Ncinzi u shaka kwetu, Jesu gwa kwa Nanzaleta? Kame u la kezi ku tu jona? Ndi li kwizi buti ndigweni, ndigwe u Cenete gwa Nyambe!”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Jesu kale ga jukukila gogo u moya u mubi nage, “Ombelela! Zwa kwa jojo unkosi!” <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />U moya u mubi kale gwa mu gwisikiza ansi no ku mu takumisa lwini mi kale gwa zwa kwakwe.<verse eid="MRK 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />A bantu bonse kale ba komokwa lwini mi kale ba li buzagula mwalyabo nabo, “Ncinzi ceci, buti twa la bona no ku shugwa u muntu a ziga ko nguzu bulyao? Gogu kame se muzigilo u muya. Ga sa tanda i myoya i mibi ko ku ji jukukila ko nguzu mi se ji la shugwa no ku zwa.” <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Aobulyo i ñambagulo ja Jesu kale ja jandulukila mwilonga lyonse lya Galileya.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa oza a bantu a bangi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Aa se ba la zwi mu njugo jo malapelelo jo majuda, Jesu no Jakobo no Joani kale ba ja ku munzi gwa Simoni no Andileya. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Kale ba ka gwana mukwe gwa Simoni na li a bulo kakuli ka li mulwele gwe elenge, mi aobulyo kale ba gambaguza Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Kale ga mu jila no ka mu kwata kwiganja ku mu kalika. Aobulyo kale ga lwaluka mi kale ga ba tendela byo ku lya.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />A matengu, ijuba aa se li la ka gwi, a bantu kale ba leta kwa Jesu a balwele na ba ka ba munitwe ku mayauma. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />A bantu a bangi ba momo mu munzi kale ba keza ku bungama a cizi co njugo umu ka kele Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Mi ige kale ga oza a bantu bonse aba ka ba lwala a malwele ga andene-andene. Kale ga tanda a mayauma ku bantu bonse aba ka ba tembekigwa kwago. Jesu ta ka zuminina a mayauma buti ga gambe cimwinya kakuli ka ga mu zekelele.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa lapela genke mu mangusu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luk 4:42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />A maca-siku ge juba na lya nungako, na ku si siite, Jesu kale ga zwa mu njugo no ku ja mu mangusu u mu na ga ka kala genke na lapela. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simoni no bagenze aa ba buka kale ba bona buti Jesu ta mu li mu njugo, aobulyo kale ba ja bu mu shaka. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Aa se ba la ka mu gwani kale ba mu ta nabo, “A bantu bonse ba mu munzi ndigwe ba shaka.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Ndokweni mu minzi jimwinya buti ndi ka tandazemo kakuli mbebyo na nda kezela.” <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Kale ga ja bu jenda mu minzi ja mwilonga lya Galileya lyonse, na ja bu tandaza a bantu mu majugo go malapelelo go Majuda no ku tanda a mayauma ku bantu.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa oza unkosi ka lwala i cisenda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Unkosi uju ka lwala i cisenda kale ga keza kwa Jesu. Kale ga tongama no ku mu kumbila nage, “Ati u la shaka, u la gola uku ndi oza no ku ndi cenesa.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Jesu kale ga mu fwila inse mi kale ga kwata jojo unkosi kwiganja no ku mu ta buti, “Ndi la shaka, u cene!” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Aobulyo i cisenda cakwe kale ca mana mi kale ga ba nenja.<verse eid="MRK 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Aobulyo Jesu kale ga mu binda wawa nage, <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />“U leke ku ja bu gambaguza a bantu buti ndime ndi la ku ozi. U je tanzi ku mupulisiti a ka ku tatube, mi u ka mu we i citagilo co ku li cenesa ku ja ko bu sa ñolela Mushe mu mulao, ubu ba botele uku tendela a bantu ba lwaluka ku cisenda. Mi nceco na ci bonise a bantu bonse buti ndiconse u la lwaluki.” <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Kono ige aa zwao kale ga ja bu gambaguza a bantu buti ndi Jesu a la mu ozi. Ko ku tenda bulyao, Jesu se ka kangwanga uku ngina mu munzi a bantu na ba mu wene mi se ka kalanga kunze mu mabikamo. Nanganceciba bulyao a bantu ka ba kezanga kwakwe na ba zwa mu minzi ji andene-andene.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Jesu aa oza unkosi ka golomene u mubili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Aa se ku la iti a majuba a mace, Jesu kale ga bogola mu munzi gwa Kapenauma kame. A bantu kale ba shugwa buti a la ka bogoli mu munzi. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Mu nako imfuwi bulyo, kale ba keza ku bungama mu njugo u mu ka li buti mane kale kwa bula no kaito nanga mpa cizi mo ku nginina. Jesu ka kwesi uku ba tandaza ijwi lya Nyambe. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Aobulyo kale kwa sika a bankosi bone aba ka ba indite unkosi ka golomene u mubili. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Kale ba kangwa uku gwana a kaito ko ka mu sisa aa ka li Jesu kebaka lyo bantu abangi. Kale ba lija a cituwa ca jejo injugo no ka jajula a kaito aa ka kalile Jesu buti ba mu itikizemo. Kale ba sezumwina ishasha aa ka lele jojo no ku mu leta afuwi no Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Jesu aa bona ubu na ba tendela kale ga ziba buti ba li zumine kwakwe mi kale ga ta jojo unkosi nage, “Mukwangu, ndi la ku kwatili i bitendantu i bimangoju byako.”<figure style="fig" alt="Mat lowered through the ceiling" file="lb00305b.jpg" size="col" loc="Mrk 2:1-5" ref="2:1-5">Kale ba jajula a kaito ku mu itikizamo</figure><verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Mo ka ba li a bazigi bo mulao bamwinya momo aba ka ba gaja mu myojo jabo nabo, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Ncinzi ci mu gambisa bulyao joju? Ga sa shwauza Nyambe kakuli takuli uju a gola uku kwatila i bitendantu i bimangoju byo bantu mbwita Nyambe!”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Jesu kale ga ziba wangu ubu ka ba gajila mi kale ga ba ta nage, “Ncinzi aa mu gaja i bigajantu bya bulyao mu myojo jenu? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />I cintu i citole uku gambila joju u mulwele ncibo, ‘Ndi la ku kwatili i bitendantu i bimangoju byako,’ kampa nku ta buti, ‘Zimana, u inde u bulo bwako u ka li jile?’ <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Cwale kuti ndi mi sunde buti ime nde Mwana Muntu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Mwana muntu” nde zina ka li kugisanga Jesu.</char></note> ndi li kwesi inguzu jo ku kwatila i bitendantu i bimangoju byo bantu aano ansi.” Jesu kale ga lola jojo unkosi ka lwala no ku mu ta buti, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Zimana, u inde u bulo bwako u jende kwilapa lyako!” <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Aobulyo u mulwele kale ga zimana, kale ga inda ishasha lyakwe no ku zwa momo mu njugo a bantu bonse na ba mu wene. Bonse kale ba komokwa no ku lumba Nyambe nabo, “Ta twa la bona i cintu ca bulyaa!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa kuga Livi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Ao kame Jesu kale ga bogola kwikamba lyeziba lya Galileya. A bantu a bangi kale ba keza ku bunganina kwikamba mi kale ga tatika uku ba ziga ijwi lya Nyambe. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Aa ka ja kwikamba kale ga bona Livi mwana Alufeyasi na kele a njugo jakwe aa ka tentekezanga a bantu. Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “U ndi umpilile buti u be u muzigigwa gwangu.” Livi kale ga leka ibi ka tenda, kale ga zimana no ku umpilila Jesu.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Ku zwao Livi kale ga kugila Jesu no bazigigwa bakwe ku njugo jakwe. Mi a batentesi a bangi mane no bantu bo bitendantu i bimangoju, kale ba ka kala nage no ku lya nage i bilyo, kakuli se ka ba li bangi ba bulyao mukati ko bantu aba se ka ba umpililanga Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />A bazigi bo mulao bamwinya aba ka ba li Bafalisi, aa ba bona Jesu na lya no bantu bo bitendantu i bimangoju, mane no batentesi, kale ba buza a bazigigwa ba Jesu nabo, “Ncinzi Jesu aa lya no batentesi mane no bantu bo bitendantu i bimangoju?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Jesu aa shugwa ibi ka ba mu ta, kale ga ba ta nage, “A bantu ta ba lwali ta ba zundangi u muangi, kono mbalwele ba zundanga u muangi. Ta na nda keza ku kuga aba ba lulikile, kono mbantu bo bitendantu i bimangoju na nda kezela ku kuga.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa buzaguligwa a ntaba jo ku li nyima i bilyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Momo mu nako a bazigigwa ba Joani mane no Bafalisi kale ba li nyima i bilyo, mi a bantu bamwinya kale ba keza ku buza Jesu nabo, “Ncinzi a bazigigwa ba Joani mane no Bafalisi aa ba linyimanga i bilyo, kono bako na ba lilila bulyo?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Jesu kale ga ba taba nage, “Sinagwe mbasele bo musesi aa ta ba goli uku li nyima i bilyo na ba si kele nage a mukiti go maseswa, no bazigigwa bangu ta ba goli uku li nyima i bilyo na ndi si kele nabo. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Kono kwa ja-majuba u musesi aa sa ka na zwisigwe mukati kabo, kuti na ba li nyimange i bilyo nabo.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />“Kame ndini a gola uku inda i cizwato co kale no ku suminao i cikamba i ciya? Kakuli i cizwato co kale kuti ci kakukile mu mbali jo cikamba ku leka imwanka inene. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Takuli uju a botele uku sintila waine u muya mu kaumbu ko kale. Kakuli waine aa sa ka fufuluke, a kaumbu kuti ka ñatuke. Mi waine no kaumbu byonse kuti bi jonauke, kono waine u muya mu kaumbu ka gongwele a botele uku sintilwa.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa gambaguza a Bafalisi byejuba lyo Nsabata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Lyo Nsabata limwinya Jesu no bazigigwa bakwe ka ba jenda mu nzila iji ka ji itila mukati kegwa lyo maila. A bazigigwa bakwe kale ba ja bu koshagula i mikunku jo maila na ba lyako u bweke. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />A Bafalisi bamwinya kale ba ta Jesu nabo, “Ngolole, a bazigigwa bako ta ba kutiki u mulao ko ku tenda ibi ta bi botele uku tendigwa mwijuba lyo Nsabata.”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Ta na mwa bala mu Mañolo ubu sa tendela Deviti aa ka fwite injala ige na ba ka jenda nabo? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Deviti kale ga ngina mu njugo ja Nyambe no ku shwauza u mulao ko ku lya u buobe bu cenete ubu ka bu botele uku ligwa ku mapulisiti bulyo. Kale ga wako na ba ka jenda nabo. (Bebyo se bi tendaala mu nako jo mupulisiti u mukulu Abbiatale.”)<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Lyo Nsabata mbantu na lya tendelwa buti li ba tuse. Mi a bantu ta na ba bumbilwa buti ba tuse ijuba lyo Nsabata. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Kebaka lelyo ime nde Mwana Muntu ndi li Mfumu mane no gwejuba lyo Nsabata.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Jesu aa oza unkosi lyo Nsabata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Inako jimwinya Jesu kale ga ngina mu njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda. Mo ka li unkosi ka juminine iganja. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />A Bafalisi kale ba mu lolelela lwini buti ba bone kampa a la gola uku oza jojo unkosi lyo Nsabata. Kame ka ba shaka ibaka lyo ku mu shangeza buti ta kutiki ijuba lyo Nsabata. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Jesu kale ga ta jojo unkosi ka juminine iganja nage, “Zimana buti a bantu bonse ba ku bone.”<verse eid="MRK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Jesu kale ga buza a bantu nage, “U mulao gwetu mbinzi gu tu zuminina uku tenda lyo Nsabata, nku tenda u bulotu kampa nku tenda u bubi? Nku yaga kampa nku jojesa?” Kono kale ba kangwa uku mu taba cimwinya.<verse eid="MRK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Kale ga lolelela a bantu bonse mu bunyegezi. Ta ka li shugwile nenja kebaka lyo bubi no ku sa shugwilisa ko bantu no bukukutu bo myojo jabo. Jesu kale ga ta jojo unkosi nage, “Golola iganja lyako.” Jojo unkosi kale ga tenda bulyao mi aobulyo iganja lyakwe kale lya goloka. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />A Bafalisi kale ba zwa mu njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda no ku ja ku batusi bo mfumu Eloda. Mi kale ba ka gambagula ubu ba botele uku yagila Jesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa oza a bantu a bangi kwiziba lya Galileya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Jesu kale ga zwamo no bazigigwa bakwe no ku ja nabo kwikamba lyeziba lya Galileya. A bantu a bangi kale ba mu umpililako mi u bungi bwabo mu malonga ga Galileya no Judeya ka ba zwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Bamwinya ka ba zwa mu munzi gwa Jelusalema no mwilonga lya Idumeya mane no mwisilya lyo Lwizi lwa Joodani, no mu minzi ja Taya no Sidoni. Bonse kale ba keza kwa Jesu kebaka lyo ku shugwa a mamakazo aga ka kwesi uku tenda.<verse eid="MRK 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Jesu kale ga ta a bazigigwa bakwe buti ba mu letele u bwato a kalemo, kebaka lyo bungi bo bantu buti ba leke uku mu bunganina lwini. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Na ga oza a balwele a bangi buti bamwinya aba ka sini uku oza ka ba senena lwini kwakwe buti nanga nku mu ku muna, ba mu kumune bulyo. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Bo mayauma aa ka ba mu bona bulyo, a mayauma ka ga ba gwisikiza ansi ambali nage na ba kumbagana buti, “Ndigwe Mwana Nyambe!” <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Kono Jesu kale ga ga jukukila buti ga leke ku mu zibaaza buti nde Mwana Nyambe.<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus preaches to the crowd from a boat" file="lb00299b.jpg" size="span" loc="Mrk 3:9-12" ref="3:9-12">Jesu aa tandaza a bantu na kele mu bwato</figure><verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa shala a batumigwa bakwe <optbreak />be kumi no bo bile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Aa na kwa mana byebyo, Jesu kale ga kambamina elundu. Kale ga kuga bonse aba ka shaka, mi kale ba keza kwakwe. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Kale ga shala be kumi no bo bile mi kale ga ba kuga buti mbatumigwa, buti ba be nage no ku ba tumanga mu minzi ku ku tandaza. <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />Kale ga ba wa ne nguzu jo ku tenda a mayauma ku bantu. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />A mazina gabo be kumi no bo bile mba,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 3:16" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 3:16">Simoni (Jesu kale ga mu gulika izina lya Pitolosi),<verse eid="MRK 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Jakobo no Joani (bana ba Zebedeya. Jesu kale ga ba gulika izina lya Boanagesi ili li toloka buti mbana mulinga go mvula).<verse eid="MRK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Kale ga shala kame no Andileya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 3:18">Filipi, Bbatolome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 3:18">Mateu, Tomasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 3:18">Jakobo (mwana Alufeyasi),</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 3:18">Tediyusi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 3:18">Simoni (uju ka kugigwa Ziloti)<verse eid="MRK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />mane no Judasi Isikaliota (uju na ga legeza Jesu).<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu ngwa nguzu ku ita Satani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mat 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Jesu kale ga ngina mu njugo, mi a bantu a bangi kale ba keza ku gwanana kame. Ige no bazigigwa bakwe kale ba kangwa uku gwana inako jo ku lya. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Bo luasi lwakwe aa se ba la shugwi bulyao kale ba jeleka u ka mu inda. Kakuli nabo se ka ba gaja buti Jesu ta si kele nenja mu ngana.<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />A bazigi bo mulao bamwinya aba ka ba zwa mu munzi gwa Jelusalema kale ba ta buti, “Ndi Bbeluzebule,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A bañoli bo mabuka gamwinya kame na ba ñola Bbelizebule kakuli nde zina limwinya lya Satani u mfumu go myoya i mibi jonse.</char></note> u mfumu go myoya i mibi a mu munite mi ndege a mu wanga inguzu jo ku tanda a mayauma ku bantu.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Jesu kale ga kuga a bantu no ku gamba nabo mu manguli nage, “Izo buti Satani a la gola uku li lwisa gemwini? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />A bantu bo mubuso gonke abo no ku li taa, gogo u mubuso gwa sa gwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Kampa a bantu bo luasi lonke buti ba li lwise mwalyabo, buti ka ba kala nenja? <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Ncintu conke no Satani aa zokela ku mwaga-mwaga a mayauma gakwe ku bantu, mu zibe buti nko ku mana kwe bi a tenda mi ta na ga zimana bu gongwele. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Mu zibe kame buti takuli u muntu a gola uku ngina mwilapa lyo muntu go kazula buti a ka ibe no ku inda u lubono lwakwe. Kono ati ngwa kazula ku mu ita, kuti a mu shumine tanzi nko kuti a mu ibile no ku inda u lubono lwakwe.<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />“Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila buti i bitendantu i bimangoju byonse no bigambo byo bunyunguluzi bo bantu, bi la gola uku kwatilwa, <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />kono u muntu gense uju a nyungulula u Moya go Kucena ta na kwatilwe, na ga tenda u mulandu go citendantu i cimangoju ici ta ci mani.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Jesu kale ga ba ta bulyao kakuli a bantu kame ka ba ta buti moya u mubi gu mu munite.<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyina no bancegwe ba Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Aobulyo nyina gwa Jesu no bancegwe kale ba sika. Kale ba zimana anze jo njugo, mi kale ba tuma u muntu buti a ka mu kuge. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />A bantu a bangi ka ba kele na ba tulite Jesu mukati. Jojo na ba tuma kale ga mu ta nage, “Ngolole, Nyoko no bancego mpanze ba li mi ndigwe ba shaka.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Jesu kale ga mu buza nage, “Maa ndini? Mi a bance gwangu mbani?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Kale ga lola a bantu aba ka ba kele nage, mi kale ga ta buti, “Baba mbo bamaa no bance gwangu. <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />U muntu gense uju a tenda i bintu ibi a shaka Nyambe, ndege ndi inda buti nde mwance gwangu no ncii jangu no maa.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Inguli jo mubyali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Jesu kale ga tatika kame uku ziga a bantu kumbali neziba. A bantu a bangi kale ba gwanana no ku mu bunganina lwini buti mane kale ga ngina mu bwato no ku kalamo. A bantu bonse kale ba kala ekamba. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Kale ga ba ziga i bintu i bingi mu manguli. Kale ga ba ta nage, <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Mu tegeleze! U mubyali jumwinya sa ka byala i mbuto jakwe. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Aa ka kwesi uku byala i mbuto, jimwinya kale ja gwila mu nzila mi i bijuni kale bya ji tolamo. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Jimwinya kale ja gwila evu ka li gwanene no mabwe mi kale ja juma wangu kebaka lyo ku bula ivu ilingi. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Aa se ka ku ja bu tukuta i bibyalantu kale bya boba kebaka lyejuba kakuli ta ka bi kwesi i miisi ji gongwele. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Imbuto jimwinya kale ja gwila mu mavuna go miga aga na ga kula no ku funkuntisa i bibyalantu. Ko ku tenda bulyao, kale bya kangwa uku aka u bweke. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Iji na ja gwila evu ilotu, kale ja mena no ku kula no ku aka lwini. Jimwinya kale ja aka u lukau lo makumi go tatwe, jimwinya makumi ga 6 mi jimwinya makumi ge kumi.”<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Uju a kwesi a matwi go ku shugwisa, a shugwe.”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Jesu aa se ka sigele genke, a bazigigwa be kumi no bo bile mane no bamwinya, kale ba keza ku mu buza ibi ka ga toloka a manguli. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Jesu kale ga ba lugwila nage, “I bintu bi zinditwe byo mubuso gwa Nyambe, na mwa bi wegwa. Kono a bantu aba ta ba zumine kwangu, kuti ba bi tegelezange mu manguli <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 4:12" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">‘Aa ba bona ibi ndi tenda, takuli ibi ba li zigao.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">Aa ba shugwa ibi ndi gamba, ta ba bi shugwilisi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">buti ba leke uku sigulukila kwangu no ku kwatilwa.’ <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Isaya 6:9</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 6:10">10</ref>.</char></note> ”<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Mi Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Aa ta mu shugwilisi jeji inguli mbuti na mu golele uku shugwilisa a manguli gamwinya? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />U mubyali ngwa ku koza u muzigi a ziga ijwi lya Nyambe. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />A bantu bamwinya mba ku koza i mbuto na ja gwila mu nzila. Ba sa shugwa ijwi, kono aobulyo Satani sa la li zwisa mu myojo jabo. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Imbuto iji na ja gwila evu lyo mabwe, ja sa julika a bantu ba shugwa ijwi no ku li tambula bu jangele. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Kono ko ku sa gongola sinagwe ncibyalantu ici ta ci kwesi i miisi ji gongwele, mba ku zumina mu nako imfuwi bulyo. A makababu no mapenzi aa bi ba kezela ko ku zumina ijwi lya Nyambe, aobulyo se ba la zeguka. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Kame a bantu bamwinya mba ku koza i mbuto na ja gwila mu mavuna go miga. Ba sa shugwa ijwi, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />kono kebaka lyo nkengejezi ja bo buno u bumi no ku suna lwini u lubono no ku shaka i bintu bimwinya, bya sa gwisa inzumino jabo jo ku zumina ijwi mi ko ku tenda bulyao, ta ba si leti i biyango. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />A bantu bo ku koza i mbuto na ja gwila mwivu ilotu, mbantu ba shugwa ijwi no ku li tambula mi ba sa leta i biyango i bingi. Bamwinya ba sa leta byo makumi go tatwe, bamwinya makumi ga 6 mi bamwinya makumi ge kumi.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inguli je lambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luk 8:16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Cwale Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Izo buti nkwali u muntu a gola uku jakiza lambi no ku mu fulumikila mu kazunga kampa uku mu tula mwisiko lyo bulo? Inga, mpantu ku bonaala ba tulanga lambi buti a bonise nenja ituba. <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Kakuli icintu conse ici ci bikitwe kuti na ci bikululwe, mi ici ci zinditwe kuti na ci zibaazwe. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Ati nkwali uju a kwesi a matwi go ku shugwisa, a shugwilise.”<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Kale ga nungako nage, “Mu tegeleze wawa ku bintu mu shugwile. Aa mu tegeleza lwini nko kuti mu shugwilise lwini. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Kakuli uju a kwesi kuti na wegwe i bintu i bingi mi uju ta kwesi kuti na tapigwe no tu a kwesi.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inguli jo bu ji menena i mbuto no ku kula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Jesu kame kale ga ta nage, “U mubuso gwa Nyambe ngwa ku koza u mulimi a byala i mbuto mwigwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />A kamwi no masiku aa tonda kampa na li a ñonzi, imbuto nku mena ji mena no ku kula, mi ta zekeleli nenja ubu ji menena no bu ji kulila. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Kakuli ivu ndelyo li menisa i mbuto mi ici ci bonaala tanzi ndutaka, ku mamaninino se lu la leta u lukunku lu kwesi u bweke bu kolete. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Inako jo ku zimbula aa ji sika, u mulimi sa la inda a kafulo na ja bu koshagula i mikunku iji ji jumite.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inguli jo lubuto u lununu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13:31-32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Jesu kale ga ta nage, “U mubuso gwa Nyambe ncinzi sa ka ndi gu kozanise kwaco? Kampa ni nguli ja buti sa ka ndi litusise mu ku gu sukulula? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Ngwa ku koza u lubuto u lununu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabuka go Cigelike mbuti ga co buti, “ndubuto lo masitete” mi ndununu lwini mi ka lu byaligwanga mu malonga go Majuda, ka lu menanga no ku kula ku ba i cishamu.</char></note> ulu lu byaligwa mwivu, <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />kono aa se lu la byaligwa, se lu la kula no ku nenea ku ita i bishamu byonse bya mwigwa, ko ntabi jaco inene i bijuni se bi la gola uku wisikiza mu munzule gwaco.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Jesu ka litusisanga a manguli ga bulyao mu ku ziga a bantu buti ba shugwilise. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />U bungi bo nako Jesu aa ka gambanga ku bantu, mu manguli ka gambanga nabo. Kono inako ka kalanga no bazigigwa bakwe, ka ba tansulwilanga i bintu byonse.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa ombeleza a makupezi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />A matengu ga lelyo ijuba Jesu kale ga ta a bazigigwa bakwe nage, “Ndokweni tu lutile mwisilya lyeziba.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />A bazigigwa kale ba ngina mu bwato no Jesu no ku tatika uku zuga ku leka a bantu bonse ekamba. Bamwinya a bantu kale ba ngina mu mato no ku ba umpilila. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Inkuli kale ja fukuka ku shanshuwisa a makupezi no ku ukusa lwini u bwato buti mane se ka bu ja bu vweta a menzi. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Bebyo aa ka bi tendaala Jesu nku lele ka lele ku mashule go bwato na samite a musamo. A bazigigwa bakwe kale ba mu busa no ku ta nabo, “Muzigi, to tu twalikizi ingana nanga no wene tu shaka uku lobela?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Jesu kale ga buka no ku jukukila inkuli no makupezi nage, “Mu ombelele!” Aobulyo inkuli no makupezi kale bya ombelela mi kale kwa ombelela lwini. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Jesu kale ga ba buza nage, “Ncinzi aa mu jogete lwini? Mu sini ku gongola mu nzumino?”<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus calms the storm" file="gt00049.jpg" size="col" loc="Mrk 4:35-41" ref="4:35-41">Jesu aa ombeleza inkuli</figure><verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />A bazigigwa kale ba joga lwini mi kale ba li buza mwalyabo nabo, “Ndini joju? Inkuli no makupezi bya sa mu kutika nabyo!”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Jesu no nkosi go mayauma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Ku zwao kale ba ka fugikila mwisilya lyeziba lya Galileya mwilonga lyo Magelaseni. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Jesu aa zwa mu bwato unkosi go moya u mubi uju ka zwa ku mabita kale ga mu shangana. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Jojo unkosi nku mabita ka kalanga mi takuli uju ka gola uku mu shumina, nanga no mawenge. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />No ku ka ba mu shuminanga ko mawenge no miala, ka bi koshagulanga byonse ibi ka ba mu shuminisanga ku matende no ku maganja. Mi takuli uju ka gola uku mu shumina nanga na gongwele buti. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />A masiku no kamwi mpa mabita ka kalanga na kumbagana no ku lila na li ñatagula gemwini ko mabwe.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Aa bona Jesu u kule kanunu kale ga mu tigilila no ku tongama afuwi nage. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Kale ga kumba keejwi inene nage, “Ncinzi ndi ku kwatile Jesu Mwana Nyambe Sakapanga, nda sa ku kumbila mwizina lya Nyambe buti u leke uku ndi bangisa!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Kale ga gamba bulyao kakuli Jesu kame ka ta a mayauma buti, “Mwe mayauma mu zwe kwakwe!”<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Jesu kale ga mu buza nage, “Izina lyako ndigweni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Ige kale ga mu taba nage, “Ndime Bangi, kakuli tu li bangi tu li kwa joju unkosi.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />A mayauma kale ga kumbila Jesu lwini buti a leke uku ga tandila u kule no ceco i cibaka.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Mpo ka gu li u mugona go banjili ka gu yangila a nsezumusi jelundu afuwi no ao. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />A mayauma kale ga kumbila Jesu nago, “Tu zuminine tu ngine mu mugona go banjili! Tu leke tu nginemo!” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Jesu kale ga ga zuminina mi a mayauma kale ga zwa kwa jojo unkosi no ka ngina mu mugona go banjili. U mugona go banjili ugu ka gu sika a 2,000 kale gwa tigilila kwi konkomwa lyeziba no ka shotaukila mwiziba no ka fwa ku menzi.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />A balisani bo banjili kale ba zwa koko ku cibaka ka ba lisikiza, no ku tigilila mu munzi no mu minzi jimwinya ja afuwi na ba ja bu gambaguza a bantu ibi na bya tendaala. A bantu kale ba jako ka bona ibi na bya tendaala. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Kale ba keza kwa Jesu no keza ku gwana jojo unkosi ka li go mayauma na kele bu liketete na zwesi mi kale ba joga. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Aba na ba bi bona bi tendaala, kale ba gambaguza a bantu ibi na bya tendaala kwa jojo unkosi go mayauma mane no byo banjili. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Mi a bantu kale ba kumbila Jesu buti aba leke no ku zwa mwilonga lyabo.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Jesu aa se ka shaka uku ngina mu bwato, jojo unkosi ka li go mayauma kale ga mu kumbila buti a ka je nage. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Kono Jesu kale ga mu kanina no ku mu ta nage, “U jende ku bakwako mi u ka ba gambaguze ibi a la ku tendeli Nyambe no bu a la ku bonisezi inse.” <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Jojo unkosi kale ga ja mu minzi i minene je kumi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kampa Dekapolisi mu mushobo go Cigelike.</char></note> na ja bu lugwila a bantu i bintu na ga mu tendela Jesu. Mi a bantu kale ba komokwa lwini aa na ba bi shugwa.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana Jailusi no mwanakazi gwelowa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Jesu kale ga luta ku ja mwisilya lyeziba ko bwato kame mi a bantu kale ba keza ku mu bunganina lwini ekamba. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Cwale jumwinya go bajendesi bo njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda gwezina lya Jailusi, kale ga kezako. Aa bona Jesu kale ga tongama afuwi nage <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />mi kale ga mu kumbila lwini nage, “Mwanangu go mukazana sa la fwa. Yawe keza u ka mu kambike a maganja buti a lwaluke no ku joja.”<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Jesu kale ga ka ja nage mi a bantu a bangi ka ba mu bunganine lwini. <verse eid="MRK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Nko ka li u mwanakazi mukati ko bantu mi ka li mulwele gwelowa mu myaka je kumi no jo bile. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Na ga penga lwini no ku jonekelwa u lubono lwakwe u mu ka ja bu lifa a baangi buti a lwaluke, kono ku ita buti a lwaluke, kale ga lwala lwini. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Aa sa shugwa bya Jesu, kale ga ngina mukati ko bantu no kezela Jesu ku mashule keza ku kwata ku mukanjo gwakwe. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Kakuli ka gaja buti, “Ati na ndi kwata ku mukanjo gwakwe bulyo, kuti ndi lwaluke.” <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Aobulyo u bulwele bwelowa kale bwa mana mi kale ga li shugwa mu mubili gwakwe buti a la lwaluki.<verse eid="MRK 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Mwa jejo inako Jesu kale ga nangula buti inguzu jakwe jimwinya ji la zwi kwakwe. Kale ga lolesa a bantu bonse aba ka ba mu bunganine no ku ba ta buti, “Ndini a la kwati ku bizwato byangu?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />A bazigigwa bakwe kale ba mu ta nabo, “Ngolole a bantu a bangi ba ku bunganine, ncinzi ci ku buzisa buti, ‘Ndini a la kwati ku mukanjo gwangu?’ ”<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Kono Jesu kale ga zundamina uku lolesa a bantu buti a bone uju a la mu kwati. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Jojo u mwanakazi ko ku ziba ibi bi la tendaali kwakwe kale ga senena kwa Jesu no keza ku tongama afuwi nage bu tutuma no ku mu gambaguza i bintu byonse na ga tenda. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Mi Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “Mwanangu, inzumino jako ji la ku ozi. U jende nenja, a mapenzi gako ga la mani.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Jesu aa ka si kwesi uku gambagula no jojo u mwanakazi, kale kwa sika a bankosi ka ba ka zwila ku njugo ja Jailusi uju ka li mujendesi go njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda. Kale ba keza ku ta nabo, “Mwano a la fwi, u leke ku tembeka u muzigi kame.”<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Kono Jesu kale ga shugwa ibi ka ba lugula babo a bankosi mi kale ga ta Jailusi nage, “U leke uku joga. U zumine bulyo.”<verse eid="MRK 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Cwale Jesu kale ga binda a bantu buti ba leke u ka ja nage mbwita Pitolosi, Jakobo no Joani (mwancegwe gwa Jakobo). <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Aa se ba la ka siki a njugo ja Jailusi u mujendesi go njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda, Jesu kale ga bona inyungani jo bantu ubu ka ba lilila no ku shambalagana. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Jesu kale ga ngina mu njugo no ku buza a bantu nage, “Ncinzi aa mu lila no ku shambalagana bulyao? U mwanuke ta fwite mbulyo a lele.”<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus raises Jairus' daughter" file="gt00050.jpg" size="col" loc="Mrk 5:36-43" ref="5:36-43">Jesu aa busa mwana Jailusi</figure><verse eid="MRK 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Kono a bantu kale ba mu sekelela. Jesu aa sa la ba zwisikizi kunze, kale ga inda bulyo isi no nyina bo mwanuke mane no bazigigwa bakwe bo tatwe no ku ngina nabo mu kampetu u mu ka lele u mwanuke. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Jesu kale ga kwata jojo u mwanuke kwiganja no ku mu ta nage, “Talita kumi!” (ku toloka buti, “Mukazana, nda sa ku lugwila, buka!”) <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Aobulyo jojo u mukazana kale ga buka no ku jenda-jenda (se ka li go myaka je kumi no jo bile). A bantu aa se ba la boni ici ci la tendaali, kale ba komokwa lwini. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Kono Jesu kale ga ba binda wawa buti ba leke ku ja bu lugwila a bantu ibi bi la tendaali. Kale ga ba lugwila bulyo buti ba mu we i bilyo a lye.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">A bantu ba Nanzaleta aa ba kana Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Ku zwao Jesu kale ga bogola ku munzi gwakwe no bazigigwa bakwe. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Lyo Nsabata na lya nungako, Jesu kale ga tatika uku ziga a bantu mu njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda mi a bantu a bangi aba ka ba mu shugwa bonse ka ba komokwa. Kale ba li buza mwalyabo nabo, “Kwibo na ga gwana a magano no nguzu ibi bi mu tendisa a mamakazo bulyao? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Ntali nde mubeji joju? Ntali nde mwana Maliya, mukulwe gu ba Jakobo, Josefa, Judasi no Simoni? Bancii jakwe ta li nabo tu kele?” Mi kale ba mu nyegelela.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “U muboni gwa Nyambe ga sa kutikigwa ku bantu bonse, mbwita bakwakwe ba mu munzi gwakwe bulyo no bo luasi lwakwe mbabo ta ba mu kutiki.” <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Jesu ta na ga tenda i makazo momo mu munzi, mbwita uku tula a maganja egulu lyo balwele a bace bulyo no ku ba oza bonse. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Kale ga komokwa kebaka lyo ku sa zumina kwabo.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Jesu aa tuma a bazigigwa be kumi no bo bile</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Cwale Jesu kale ga ja bu zimbuluka mu minzi jonse na ja bu ziga a bantu. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Jesu kale ga kuga a batumigwa bakwe be kumi no bo bile no ku ba tuma bo bile-bo bile. Kale ga ba wa no nguzu jo ku tanda a mayauma. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Kale ga ba ta nage, “Mu leke ku inda cimwinya mu lujendo nanga mbuobe, nanga mukotana, kampa a masheleñi mbwita u lutaga bulyo.” <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Kale ga ba ta kame buti, “Mu sugale bulyo inshangu, kono mu leke uku inda i bijabalo i bingi. <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Aa mu sika mu munzi, mu kale bulyo a mubanda aa mu la sikili ku twala aa na mu zwe momo mu munzi. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Mi mu munzi u mu ta ba mi tambuli no ku mi tegeleza, aa mu zwamo mu kunkumune isukwe ku matende genu ili na li be u bupaki ubu na bu lete buti ba atuligwe.”<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />A bazigigwa kale ba ja bu tandaza a bantu buti ba leke i bitendantu i bimangoju byabo buti ba sigulukile kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Kale ba tanda a mayauma ku bantu a bangi no ku singa a balwele a bangi a mafuta no ku ba oza.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joani u mukolobezi aa kosholigwa u mutwi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />U mfumu Eloda kale ga shugwa bya Jesu kakuli izina lyakwe se ka li jite impuwo. A bantu bamwinya se ka ba ta buti, “Ndi Joani u mukolobezi na ga ka buka ku zwa ku bafu mpaa tenda lwini a mamakazo a manene bulyao.” <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Bamwinya nabo, “Ndi Eliya.” Mi mane bamwinya kame ba ta buti, “Muboni gwa Nyambe nage sinagwe mbaboni ba Nyambe bo kale.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Kono Eloda aa shugwa byebyo kale ga ta nage, “Joani uju na nda koshola u mutwi, na ga ka buka ka zwa ku bafu?”<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Kakuli mu nako ja ku mashule, Eloda sa tuma a masole buti ba ka shumine Joani no ka mu tula mu ntolongo. Sa tenda bulyao buti a jangaze Elodiyasi uju se ka li mukazi gwakwe. Etanzi Elodiyasi ka li muka Filipi mwancegwe gwa Eloda. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Joani kale ga nyaza Eloda buti “To botele uku sesa muka mwancego.” <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Mi Elodiyasi ka zimbite Joani mane ka shakanga uku mu yaga kono ta ka kwesi inguzu jo ku tenda bulyao uku Eloda ta la mu zuminini. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Kakuli Eloda ka jogete no ku kutika Joani ko ku ziba buti Joani ka li muntu ka lulikile no kucena. Eloda aa sa la shugwi bya Joani, kale ga zielea wawa, kono nanganceciba ka shakanga uku mu tegeleza.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Elodiyasi kale ga ba ne ntonoolo. Ijuba lyo mukiti go ku li vulusa uku bonigwa kwa Eloda, kale ga tendela i bilyo i bingi a bakulu bo munso, no bakulu bo masole mane no manduna bo minzi jelonga lya Galileya. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Mwana Elodiyasi go mukazana kale ga keza ku nenga ku jangaza Eloda no banyenda bonse aba na ba kugigwa. Aobulyo u mfumu Eloda kale ga mu ta nage, “U kumbile conse ici u shaka mi kuti ndi ci ku we.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Kale ga konka buti, “Kuti ndi ku we i cintu conse ici sa ka u kumbile nanga ndi cika lyo mubuso gwangu.”<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Jojo mukazana kale ga ja kwa nyina no ka mu buza nage, “Ncinzi sa ka ndi kumbile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Nyina kale ga taba nage, “U ka mu kumbile u mutwi gwa Joani u mukolobezi!”<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Aobulyo u mukazana kale ga welangila ku mfumu Eloda no ka mu ta nage, “Mutwi gwa Joani u mukolobezi ndi kumbila, u gu ndi tulile a kasuba ko ku galama aano!”<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />U mfumu Eloda kale ga zielea lwini ko nkuluwizi jakwe, kono kebaka lyo ku konka na ga konka akati ko bantu, kale ga kangwa uku mu nyima. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Aobulyo kale ga tuma u musole ku ntolongo ka koshola Joani u mutwi no ka gu mu letela. U musole kale ga ka koshwela Joani u mutwi mu ntolongo, <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />no ka gu leta a kasuba ko ku galama. Kale ga keza ku gu wa jojo u mukazana mi ige kale ga gu twalila nyina. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />A bazigigwa ba Joani aa se ba la shugwi ibi bi la tendaali, kale ba keza ku inda i citupu ca Joani no ka ci bika mwibita.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa ngiisa a maobe no ku ga wa <optbreak />a bantu ba 5,000</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Joa 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />A batumigwa aa se ba la ka bogoli, kale ba keza ku lugula kwa Jesu ibi na ba ja bu ziga no ku tenda. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Ndokweni tu ka kale twenke ku cibaka ci ombelele tu ka wise.” Kale ga ba ta bulyao kakuli a bantu ka ba li bangi aba ka ba ba kezela buti mane no nako jo ku lya i bilyo ta ka ba ji kwesi.<verse eid="MRK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Mi Jesu no bazigigwa bakwe kale ba ngina mu bwato no ku lutila mwisilya lyeziba ku cibaka ci ombelele uku ka ba gola u ka kala bonke. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Kono a bantu a bangi kale ba ba bona na ba funduka mi ko ku ziba ku cibaka ci ombelele uku ka ba botele uku ja, kale ba li tangizako mi kale ba ka sika Jesu no bazigigwa bakwe na ba sini ka sikako. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Jesu no bazigigwa bakwe aa ba ka zwa mu bwato, kale ba ka gwana a bantu a bangi mi Jesu kale ga ba fwila inse. Kale ga ba bona mane sinagwe ningu ta ji kwesi u mulisani mi kale ga tatika uku ba ziga i bintu i bingi.<verse eid="MRK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Ijuba aa se ka li shaka u ka gwa, a bazigigwa ba Jesu kale ba keza kwakwe no keza ku mu ta buti, “Se masiku, kame mo muno mu mangusu. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />U te a bantu ba jende mu minzi ja afuwi buti ba ka ligulile i bilyo.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Kono Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Mu ba we i bilyo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">A bazigigwa bakwe kale ba mu taba nabo, “Kwibo sa ka tu bi gwane? Kame nanga masheleñi ga shakaala mangi aga tu gola uku belekela mu myezi ja 8<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kampa 200 dinali mu mabuka go kale go Cigelike. Mi I dinali lyonke ka li li isheleñi ka li belekelwa ijuba mukatumbi.</char></note> buti tu gulile i bilyo bonse baba a bantu!”<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Jesu kale ga ba buza nage, “Nga mu shakisise! Makoto goti go buobe mu kwesi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Aa se ba la zibi kale ba mu ta buti, “Makoto ga 5 tu kwesi nonswi jo bile bulyo.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Aobulyo Jesu kale ga ba ta buti ba kalike a bantu a lwanza mu tugugi. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Mi a bantu kale ba kala mu tugugi to makumi ge kumi no mu tugugi to makumi ga 5. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Jesu kale ga inda a makoto ga 5 go buobe nonswi jo bile. Kale ga ligamina kwigulu no ku litumela, mi kale ga inda a makoto no ku ga komagula. Cwale kale ga bi wa a bazigigwa bakwe buti ba taile a bantu. Kale ga inda nonswi bulyao ku ba taila bonse. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />A bantu bonse kale ba lya ku kuta. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Aa se ba la mani bonse, a bazigigwa kale ba vumba i bitundu bye kumi no byo bile byo bubugulusi bo buobe ubu nabwa sigala nonswi. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />A bankosi ba sika a 5,000 no maasi gabo bulyao bonse kale ba lya ku kuta.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa jenda a menzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Joa 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Aa na kwa mana bulyo byebyo, Jesu kale ga indikiza a bazigigwa buti ba ngine mu bwato no ku lutila mwisilya lyeziba mu munzi gwa Bbesaida. Ige kale ga sigala na lugwila a bantu buti ba bogole ku minzi jabo. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Aa sa la li lagani no bantu, Jesu kale ga kambamina ku malundu no ka lapela genke.<verse eid="MRK 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />A masiku, a bazigigwa se ka ba li mu bwato akati keziba Jesu na si ka sigele genke ekamba. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Kale ga bona buti a bazigigwa bakwe mu bukababu ka ba zuga kebaka lyo nkuli ka ji unga ku shanshuwisa a makupezi. A nako ba tungulanga ba silukombwe, Jesu kale ga ba kezela na jenda a menzi mi kale ga tenda sinagwe kame aba itilila. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />A bazigigwa aa ba mu bona a jenda a menzi, kale ba gaja buti ncilumba mi kale ba kumbagana. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Bonse kale ba tutuma aa ba mu bona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Aobulyo Jesu kale ga ba ta buti, “Mu leke uku joga! Ndime. Mu li gongoze.” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Jesu kale ga ngina mu bwato mi inkuli kale ja ombelela. Bonse kale ba komokwa lwini, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />kakuli ka ba sini ku shugwilisa ubu na ga ngiila a makoto go buobe nonswi, mi nabo ka ba si kwesi i ciulu.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Kale ba ka fugikila ekamba lya mwilonga lya Genenzaleta mwisilya lyeziba. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Aa se ba la zwi mu bwato, a bantu kale ba ziba Jesu, <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />mi bonse aba na ba mu shugwa momo mwilonga lyonse kale ba nanuna a bishani a balwele no ku ba twala konse uku ka ba shugwa buti nkoko a li Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Mi mu minzi jonse u mu ka ja, i minunu no minene, mane no minzi jimwinya ka ba leta a balwele mu bibaka byo magulikizo. Ka ba kumbilanga Jesu buti a zuminine a balwele uku mu kwata bulyo nanga nku ncinko jo mukanjo gwakwe. Bonse aba ka ba mu kwata ka ba lwaluka.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Jesu aa ziga byo ku li cenesa mu mojo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Mat 15:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Ijuba limwinya, a Bafalisi no bazigi bo mulao kale ba zwa mu munzi gwa Jelusalema keza ku bona Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Kale ba bona a bazigigwa ba Jesu bamwinya na ba lya i bilyo uku ta ba la shambi ku maganja. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />(A Bafalisi bonse no Majuda ka ba li bantu ba umpilila i cizo co mijojelo jo bakulu jo ku sa lya i bilyo uku ta ba la shambi ku maganja no maboko. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Nanga na ba ka zwa ku bibaka byo magulikizo, ta ba goli uku lya uku ta ba la shambi ku maganja no maboko. Mi mba ku umpilila i mitendelo i mingi jo cizo iji na ba leka basukuzabo jo ku sanza a makomoki, u tuzunga no manketele.)<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />A Bafalisi no bazigi bo mulao kale ba buza nabo, “Ncinzi a bazigigwa bako aa ta ba kutiki ibi na ba tu ziga a bakulu? Ncinzi aa ba lya i bilyo uku ta ba la shambi ku maganja no ku maboko gonse?”<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Jesu kale ga ba taba nage, “Isaya mbyaconse na ga bona ibi bi mi julika, inwe mwe bantu betasanga, aa sa ñola buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 7:6" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">‘Baba a bantu ba sa ndi kutika bulyo mu bigambo byabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">kono mu myojo jabo mbingi ba li gajila.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Takuli intuso nanga na ba ndi lapela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">kakuli milao jo bantu ba ziga sinagwe nkwa Nyambe ji <optbreak />zwa kanti njabo bulyo.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">Isaya 29:13</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />“Kakuli mwa sa shwauza i milao ja Nyambe no ku kutika bulyo i milao jo cizo co bantu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Kale ga ba ta kame buti, “Mu li kwesi i mitendelo jo ku kana i milao ja Nyambe buti mu zundamine bulyo ku cizo cenu! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Kakuli Mushe sa gamba nage, ‘U kutike isho no nyoko,’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Lujendo 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Mulao 5:16</ref>.</char></note> mi ‘U muntu gense uju a gambila isi kampa nyina a majwi a mamangoju, a li botele uku yagigwa.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:17">Lujendo 21:17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:9">Livitike 20:9</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Kono inwe mwa sa ta a bantu buti, mbobo a bana aa ba ta a bazazi babo buti, ‘Mu ndi kwatile, ta ndi goli uku mi tusa kakuli i cintu ndi kwesi kame na nda li konka buti na ndi ci we Nyambe.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />Aa mu kwesi uku tenda bulyao, mwa sa ba letela buti ba shwauze a bazazi babo a bampale. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Mwa sa shwauza ibi sa gamba Nyambe ko cizo cenu ici mu ziga, mi gogu ngo mwanza go bintu bimwinya mu ziga.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Kame Jesu kale ga kuga a bantu a bangi no ku ba ta buti, “Mu ndi tegeleze mi mu shugwilise byebi. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Ntali mbilyantu bi gola uku jona u muntu kono mbigajantu ibi bi zwa mu mojo go muntu bi gola uku mu jona. <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />U muntu gense uju a kwesi a matwi go ku shugwisa a shugwilise.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabuka go Cigelike gamwinya no mabuka gamwinya ta ga kwesi intimana ja 16.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Mi Jesu kale ga ngina mu njugo no bazigigwa bakwe ku zwa ku bantu. A bazigigwa kale ba mu buza ibi ka ji toloka jejo inguli. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Jesu kale ga ba buza nage, “Nenwe ta mu la ji shugwilisi jeji inguli? Ta mwizi buti takuli i cilyantu ici a lya u muntu ici ci gola uku mu jona? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Kakuli i bilyantu ta bi ngini mu mojo go muntu, mbulyo bi itila mwivumo no ka zwila kunze jo mubili gwakwe.” (Ko ku ta bulyaa Jesu kame ka ta buti i bilyo byonse bi li cenete.)<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Jesu kale ga ba ta kame buti, “Mukati ko mojo go muntu momo ku zwa ibi bi jona u muntu. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Kakuli mu mojo go muntu momo ku zwa i bigajantu i bimangoju, i cise, u busa, u buyagi, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />i cise, inkole, u bubi, a manya, u bululu, u muna, u busebe, uku litunta no bugelo. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Byonse byebyo i bintu i bimangoju, mu mojo bi zwa, mi mbebyo bi jona u muntu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inzumino jo mwanakazi uju ta li u Mujuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mat 15:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Jesu kale ga zwa mwilonga lya Galileya no ku ja ku mutulo kwilonga lya Taya. Ta ka shaka buti a bantu ba zibe buti mu njugo jibo a sikile. Kono ta ka gola uku zinda ku bantu. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Aobulyo u mwanakazi uju na ga shugwa bya Jesu kale ga keza ku tongama afuwi nage. Mwane go mukazana moya u mubi ka gu mu tembekete, <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />mi kale ga kumbila Jesu buti a ka tande gogo u moya u mubi ku gu zwisa kwa mwane go mukazana. Jojo u mwanakazi ta ka li Mujuda,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabuka gamwinya mbuti ga co izo ka li Mugelike.</char></note> kono mu munzi gwa Fenisiya ka zwa mwilonga lya Siliya.<verse eid="MRK 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “Ta ndi botele uku lela a bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda ku leka a bakwangu a Majuda. Kakuli ta ku botele u muntu aa inda i bilyo byo banuke no ku bi wa a bambwa.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Kono jojo u mwanakazi kale ga mu ta nage, “Mbyaconse mfumwangu, kono nanga mbambwa ba la ku lya u bubugulusi bu la gwili aa ba le ku lila a banuke.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Jesu kale ga mu ta buti, “U la gambi nenja, bogola kakuli gogo u moya u mubi ka gu tembeka mwano gu la zwi.” <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Kale ga bogola ku munzi gwakwe mi kale ga ka gwana u moya u mubi gu la zwi kwa mwane. Kale ga ka mu gwana a lele nenja a bulo bu ombelele.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa oza unkosi uju ta ka shugwa no ku gamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Jesu kale ga zwa mu munzi gwa Taya. Kale ga itila mwilonga lya Sidoni no ku sezumukila kwiziba lya Galileya mane kale ga sika no kwilonga lya Dekapolisi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dekapolisi ndizina lyo Cigelike ili li toloka Ilonga lyo minzi je kumi.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Momo mwilonga a bantu kale ba leta kwa Jesu unkosi uju ta ka shugwa no ku gamba, mi kale ba mu kumbila buti a mu tule a maganja egulu no ku mu lapelela.<verse eid="MRK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Jesu kale ga mu zwisa mukati ko bantu no ku ja nage kumbali. Kale ga nginika i minwe jakwe mu matwi ga jojo unkosi. Kale ga li suwila no mate ku minwe no ku kwata u lulimi lwakwe. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Jesu kale ga ligamina kwigulu kale ga esumuka mi kale ga ta buti, “Efata!” (ku tolokezo, “U fwinkulwe!”). <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Aobulyo kale ga tatika uku shugwa, mi u lulimi lwakwe kale lwa shumunuka no ku tatika uku gamba nenja.<verse eid="MRK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Cwale Jesu kale ga ba lugwila buti ba leke ku gambaguza u muntu gense. Kono ubu ka ba kanisiza uku gamba, mbobo ka ba ja bu gambagwiza a bantu. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Mi a bantu ka ba komokwa lwini no ku jangala. A bantu ka ba ta buti, “Byonse i bintu a tenda ka bi lulikila nenja, buti nanga mbantu ta ba shugwi nku shugwa na ba ta ba gambi nku gamba.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Jesu aa ngiisa a maobe no ku ga wa <optbreak />a bantu ba 4,000</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mat 15:32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Momo mu majuba a bantu a bangi kame kale ba bunganina aa ka li Jesu mi kale ba maninwa i bilyo. Jesu kale ga kuga a bazigigwa bakwe no ku ba ta nage, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Nda sa fwila a bantu inse kakuli se majuba go tatwe na ba kele neme mi ta ba si kwesi i bilyo. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Buti ndi ba bogoze ku minzi jabo bulyao, kuti ba kangwe uku jenda nenja ko ku ta buti bamwinya nkule ka ba zwa.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />A bazigigwa bakwe kale ba mu ta nabo, “Mbuti tu botele uku gwanina i bilyo byo ku ba wa bonse buti ba kute mo muno mu mangusu?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Jesu kale ga ba buza nage, “Mbuobe bu sika kwibo mu kwesi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Kale ba mu taba nabo, “Makoto ga 7 bulyo tu kwesi.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Jesu kale ga ta a bantu buti ba kale ansi. Kale ga inda gago a makoto ga 7, kale ga litumela kwa Nyambe, mi kale ga ga taila a bazigigwa bakwe mi abo kale ba ga komagula no ku ga taila a bantu. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Kale ba gwana no tuswi u tuce mi Jesu kale ga tu kumbilila imfwijaguzi nato no ku ta a bazigigwa bakwe buti ba tu taile a bantu. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />A bantu kale ba lya ku kuta. Aa na ba mana, a bazigigwa kale ba vumba i bitundu bya 7 byo bilyo na bya sigala. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Ka ba li bantu ka ba botele uku sika a mpalo ja 4,000 lelyo ijuba. Aa se ba la mani uku lya, Jesu kale ga ba ta buti ba bogole ku minzi jabo. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Aa se bi la mani byebyo, Jesu no bazigigwa bakwe kale ba ngina mu bwato mi kale ba shatukila mwisilya lyeziba kwilonga lya Dalumanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa kana uku tenda i makazo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat 12:38-42</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">16:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />A Bafalisi aa ba shugwa buti Jesu a la siki, kale ba keza kwakwe no keza ku tatika uku li kanana nage. Kame ka ba mu jeleka buti aba sunde i cijuliko co cintu conse ca mwigulu ici ci sunda inguzu jakwe. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Jesu kale ga esumuka wawa mi kale ga ta buti, “Aba a bantu mba ku indikila uku tendelwa i cijuliko bulyo! Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila buti takuli i cijuliko sa ka ndi tendele lo luno u luasi.” <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Aobulyo kale ga ngina mu bwato no ku ba leka, mi kale ga shatukila mwisilya lyeziba.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">U mumela go Bafalisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mat 16:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />A bazigigwa ba Jesu na ba zibala uku inda i bilyo. Ndikoto lyonke bulyo lyo buobe ka ba indite mu bwato. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Aa ka ba luta iziba bulyao, Jesu kale ga ba nanguza nage, “Mu nangule u mumela go Bafalisi no gwa Eloda.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />A bazigigwa kale ba tatika uku li gambaguza mwalyabo nabo, “Aa gamba bulyao, mpaa wene buti ta tu kwesi u buobe?” <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Jesu ko ku ziba ibi ka ba gambagula a bazigigwa bakwe kale ga ba buza nage, “Ncinzi aa mu li gambaguza byo ku bula u buobe? A mensho mu li kwesi ncinzi aa ta mu boni no ku shugwilisa? Kampa i myojo jenu nje mi kukutu? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />A mensho no matwi mu li kwesi kono mwa sa kangwa uku shugwa no ku bona? Mi ncinzi aa ta mu vuluki? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Aa se ndi komagula a makoto ga 5 go buobe no ku wa a bantu ba 5,000, mbitundu byoti na mwa vumba byo bubugulusi ubu na bwa sigala?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Kale ba mu taba nabo, “Mbye kumi no byo bile.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />“Alya se ndi komagwila a bantu ba 4,000 a makoto ga 7 go buobe, mbitundu byoti na mwa vumba byo bubugulusi ubu na bwa sigala?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Kale ba mu taba nabo, “Mbya 7.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Kale ga ba ta nage, “No aano mu sini uku shugwilisa?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa oza unkosi u muofu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Kale ba ja ku munzi gwa Bbesaida mi a bantu kale ba mu letela unkosi go muofu mi kale ba mu kumbila buti a mu kwate no ku mu oza. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Jesu kale ga mu kwata kwiganja no ku ja nage kunze jo munzi. Mi kale ga mu suwila a mate mu mensho, kale ga mu tula a maganja mi kale ga mu buza nage, “Nko ci li ici u wene?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Jojo unkosi kale ga lola mu mbali mi kale ga taba nage, “Ee, ndi liwene a bantu kono ba sa bonaala sinagwe mbishamu bi jenda-jenda.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Jesu kale ga mu kwata no maganja a mensho gakwe. Cwale aa lola, a mensho gakwe kale ga bona, mi kale ga bona i bintu byonse nenja. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Jesu kale ga mu fundula nage, “U leke uku bogola momu mu munzi, u jende bulyo ku munzi gwenu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pitolosi aa gamba buti Jesu ndini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mat 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Jesu no bazigigwa bakwe kale ba zwa mwilonga lya Galileya mi kale ba ja mu minzi ka ji li afuwi no munzi u munene ka gu kugigwa Sesaleya Filipi. Aa ka ba jenda bulyao, Jesu kale ga ba buza nage, “A bantu mbuti ba ndi tela, nabo ndimeni?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Kale ba mu taba nabo, “Bamwinya kame ba ta buti ndigwe Joani u mukolobezi, bamwinya nabo ndigwe Eliya mi bamwinya nabo u li jumwinya go baboni ba Nyambe.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Mi kale ga ba buza nage, “Ingenwe mbuti mu co, buti ndimeni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Pitolosi kale ga mu taba nage, “Ndigwe Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Kono Jesu kale ga ba nanguza buti ba leke uku mu lugula bulyao ku bantu.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa lugula byo lufu lwakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mat 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Ku zwao Jesu kale ga tatika uku ba lugwila buti Mwana Muntu a li botele uku penga mu bintu i bingi no ku kanigwa ku bakulu, no ku mapulisiti a bakulu mane no ku bazigi bo mulao. Kuti na yagigwe, kono aa na ku ite a majuba go tatwe kuti na buke ku zwa ku bafu. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Kale ga gambaguza a bazigigwa byebyo na bugukite. Pitolosi kale ga mu kugila kumbali no ka mu binda buti a leke uku gambanga bulyao.<verse eid="MRK 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Jesu kale ga litemuna ku bazigigwa bakwe mi kale ga jukukila Pitolosi nage, “Zwa kwangu Satani! Gwa sa bona i bintu ko mensho go buntu, ku ita uku bi bona ubu a bi wenene Nyambe.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Jesu kale ga kuga a bantu a bangi buti ba gwanane no bazigigwa bakwe mi kale ga ba ta buti, “Ati kwenu nkwali uju a shaka buti a ndi umpilile, a buguke mi a zwe ku lyoga. Nanga na ngina mu mapenzi, a ndi umpilile. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Ati no twalikiza lwini ingana ku bumi bwako, kuti na bu jonauke. Kono ati no zwisa ingana jo ku mamela lwini u bumi bwako kebaka lyangu no majwi a malotu gangu, kuti no bu jojese. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Mbulotunzi bu lio ati muntu aa muna ilonga lyonse kono ige nko ku jonekelwa u bumi bwakwe? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Buti nko ci li i cintu ci ita u bumi bwako? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Ati u muntu na ndi fwila inshoni ime no majwi gangu mo muno mu nako jo luasi lo cise no bitendantu i bimangoju, neme nde Mwana Muntu kuti na ndi mu fwile inshoni aa sa ka na ndi ka bogole mu mpazimo ja Tata no mañiloi gakwe ga cenete.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila buti, bamwinya ba zimene aano ta na ba fwe uku na ba sini uku bona u mubuso gwa Nyambe na gu keza ko nguzu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa bonaala uku pazima sinagwe ndituba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mat 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Aa se ku la iti a majuba ga 6, Jesu kale ga inda Pitolosi, Jakobo no Joani no ku ja nabo kwilundu ile uku na ba ka kala bonke. Jesu kale ga ja bu tuba lwini no ku pazima mbwita ba mu liwenene. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />I bizwato byakwe kale bya tuba lwini ku ita i bintu byonse byo ku tuba bya aano elonga. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Mi aobulyo kale kwa bonaala Eliya no Mushe na ba gambagula no Jesu.<verse eid="MRK 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Pitolosi kale ga ta Jesu nage, “Muzigi, mbulotu aa ka tu kala bulyo aano. U leke tu jake i bikutu byo tatwe, cimwinya ci be cako, cimwinya ci be ca Mushe mi cimwinya ci be ca Eliya.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />(Kale ga gamba bulyao kakuli na ba joga lwini mi Pitolosi ta kezi co ku gamba.)<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Kale kwa keza ijoba no ku ba vwika mi kale kwa shugwaala ijwi mwijoba li ta buti, “Joju ndi Mwanangu mi ndi la mu shaka lwini. Mu mu shugwe!” <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Aobulyo, aa se ba lola kale ba bona buti Mushe no Eliya ta ba si bonaali. Kale ba bona Jesu na sigele nabo bulyo.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Aa ka ba sezumuka na ba zwa elundu, Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Na mu leke uku gambaguza u muntu gense i bintu mu la boni mbwita Mwana Muntu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Mwana muntu” nde zina ka li kugisanga Jesu.</char></note> aa na buke ku zwa ku bafu.” <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Kale ba bi zinda, kono ka ba li buzanga mwalyabo ibi ka toloka aa ka ta buti, “aa na buke ku zwa ku bafu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Mi kale ba buza Jesu nabo, “Ncinzi a bazigi bo mulao aa ba ta buti Eliya a li botele uku keza tanzi?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Jesu kale ga ba taba nage, “Ndiconse Eliya a li botele uku keza tanzi buti a keze a tende i bintu byonse nenja. Cwale ncinzi aa ku ñoletwe buti Mwana Muntu a li botele uku penga lwini no ku kanigwa? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Nda sa mi lugwila buti Eliya sa keza mi na ba mu tenda i bintu byonse ibi ka ba shaka uku ja ubu ku ñolelwe mu Mañolo.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa oza u muninzana <optbreak />go moya u mubi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-20">Mat 17:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Aa se ba la siki ku bazigigwa bamwinya, kale ba gwana a bantu a bangi ba ba zimbulukite mane no bazigi bo mulao aba ka ba li kanana nabo. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />A bantu aa ba bona Jesu, kale ba komokwa lwini mi kale ba mu tigilila no ka mu zuminiza.<verse eid="MRK 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Jesu kale ga buza a bazigigwa bakwe nage, “Mbinzi mu li kanana nabo?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Unkosi jumwinya mukati ko bantu kale ga taba nage, “Muzigi, ndi mwanangu ndi la leti kwako, moya u mubi gu mu munite ugu gu shumine u lulimi lwakwe mi ga sa kangwa uku gamba. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Mi aa gu mu bukilanga gwa sa mu gwisikizanga ansi, no ku mu tufulisanga ifulo ku kanwa no ku mu kwekisanga lwini a meno, mi gu la ku mu golomezanga lwini. Ndi la kumbili a bazigigwa bako buti ba gu tande kono ba la kangwi uku gu tanda.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Jesu kale ga ba taba nage, “Inwe mwe luasi ta lu zumine! Ni nako ji sika kwibo na ndi kale nenwe? Ndusiku nzi na mu ndi zumine? Leta mwano kuno.”<verse eid="MRK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Kale ba leta jojo u muninzana kwa Jesu. U moya u mubi aa gu bona Jesu, kale gwa mu gwisikiza ansi. Kale ga gala-gala no ku tufula ifulo ku kanwa.<verse eid="MRK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Jesu kale ga buza isi nage, “Ndusiku nzi na gwa mu gwana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Isi kale ga mu taba nage, “Nkale na gwa mu gwana ku zwa bulyao ku bwanuke bwakwe. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />U moya u mubi gu la ku mu gwisikisanga mwiziko kampa mu menzi buti gu mu yage. Ati u la gola uku tendao cimwinya, u tu fwile inse mi u tu tuse.”<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Jesu kale ga mu buza nage, “Ncinzi u toloka aa u ta buti, ‘Ati u la gola’? Ati u muntu na zumina i bintu byonse bya sa golaala.”<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Isi kale ga jukuka lwini nage, “Ndi la zumina, u ndi tuse ndi zundamine mu ku zumina bulyao!”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Jesu aa bona buti a bantu se ka ba ja bu ngiya lwini, kale ga jukukila gogo u moya u mubi nage, “U zwe kwa joju u mwanuke igwe gwe moya u mubi, igwe u mu kangwisanga uku shugwa no ku sa gamba. No leke ka mu bogwela kame!”<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Mi u moya u mubi kale gwa takuma lwini no ku nyakagulisa lwini jojo u muninzana mi kale gwa zwa kwakwe. Jojo u muninzana se ka lapamite no ku bonaala sinagwe ncitupu, mi a bantu a bangi kale ba ta nabo, “A la fwi.” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Kono Jesu kale ga mu kwata kwiganja buti a zimane mi kale ga zimana.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Aa na kwa mana byebyo, Jesu aa se ka li mu njugo no bazigigwa bakwe bulyo, abo kale ba mu buza nabo, “Ncinzi iswe aa na twa kangwa uku gu tanda?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Jesu kale ga ba taba nage, “U moya gwa gogu u mufuta, ngwa ku tanda bulyo ko ntapelo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabuka gamwinya go kale na ga nungako “no ku li nyima i bilyo.”</char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa gamba byo lufu lwakwe lyabili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Jesu no bazigigwa bakwe kale ba zwa momo mu cibaka no ku itila mwilonga lya Galileya. Jesu ta ka shaka buti a bantu ba zibe uku ka li. <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />Kakuli kame ka shaka uku kala no bazigigwa bakwe bulyo buti aba zige. Kale ga ba ta nage, “Ime nde Mwana Muntu kuti na ndi legezigwe buti a bantu aba ba ndi zimbite ba ndi kwate. Kuti na ba ndi yage, mi aa na ku ite a majuba go tatwe ku zwao, kuti na ndi buke ku zwa ku bafu.” <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Kono a bazigigwa bakwe ta ka ba shugwilisa ibi ka gamba, kono nanganceciba ka ba jogete uku mu buza ibi ka ta.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">U munene mu mubuso gwa Nyambe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Kale ba keza no mu munzi gwa Kapenauma. Jesu no bazigigwa bakwe aa ka ba li mu njugo, kale ga ba buza nage, “Mbinzi ka mu ja bu li kanana mu nzila?” <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Kono kale ba kangwa uku mu taba cimwinya kakuli kame ka ba ja bu li kanana buti u munene mukati kabo ndini. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Jesu kale ga kala ansi mi kale ga kuga a bazigigwa bakwe be kumi no bo bile, no ku ba ta nage, “Uju a shaka uku ba gwe tanzi a li botele uku ba go mamaninino no ku ba u muika go bantu bonse.”<verse eid="MRK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Kale ga inda u mwanuke no ku mu zimika mukati kabo. Mi kale ga mu nanuna mi kale ga ba ta buti, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“U muntu gense uju a tambula u mwanuke mwizina lyangu sinagwe bulyaa, ndime a la tambuli. Kame u muntu gense uju a ndi tambula, ta li ndime bulyo a la tambuli kono a la tambuli no Tata uju na ga ndi tuma.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uju ta tu lwisi ndi mugenzetu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luk 9:49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Joani kale ga ta Jesu nage, “Muzigi, na twa bona u muntu ka tanda a mayauma mwizina lyako, mi kale twa mu binda kakuli ta ka li mugenzetu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Jesu kale ga ta nage, “Ta na mu la mu bindi, kakuli takuli u muntu a gola uku tenda i makazo mwizina lyangu uju sa ka je bu ndi kwaga u bumangoju. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />U muntu gense uju ta tu lwisi ndi mugenzetu. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila, u muntu gense uju a mi wa inkomoki jo menzi kebaka lyo ku ta buti nku Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe mu kumbi, wawa jojo u muntu kuti na wegwe u mupuzo.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uku sitagalisa bamwinya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mat 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />“Kono ati u muntu na sitagalisa jumwinya gwa baba a banuke aba ba zumine kwangu buti a tende i bitendantu i bimangoju, u bulotu nku mu sungilila ibwe mu nsingo no ku mu shonjela mwiwate. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Ati iganja lyako na li ku sitagalisa, u li koshole. U bulotu nku ngina mu bumi ta bu mani ne ganja lyonke ku ita u ka ngina mwileba lyo mulilo ta gu zimi no maganja go bile, <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />umu ku li a masene aga ta ga fwi aga ga lya i bitupu mane no mu ku li u mulilo ugu ta gu zimi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabuka go Cigelike gamwinya no mabuka gamwinya ta ga kwesi intimana ja 44.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Ati itende lyako na li ku sitagalisa, u li koshole. U bulotu nku ngina mu bumi ta bu mani netende lyonke ku ita uku ngina mwileba lyo mulilo no matende go bile, <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />umu ku li a masene aga ta ga fwi mane no mulilo ugu ta gu zimi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabuka go Cigelike gamwinya no mabuka gamwinya ta ga kwesi intimana ja 46.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Mi ati i linsho lyako na li ku sitagalisa, u li nonkole, kakuli u bulotu nku ngina mu mubuso gwa Nyambe no linsho lyonke ku ita uku ngina mwileba lyo mulilo no mensho go bile,<verse eid="MRK 9:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />‘umu ku li a masene aga ta ga fwi aga ga lya i bitupu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 9:48">mane no mu ku li u mulilo ugu ta gu zimi.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:24">Isaya 66:24</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />“U muntu gense kuti na lungisigwe ko mulilo. <verse eid="MRK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Izwai ndilotu, uku li lungisa kono aa li shamua takuli ubu mu botele uku li tendela. Mu be no mujojelo u mulotu sinagwe ndizwai ili ta li sampuki, mi mu joje nenja no bagenzenu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Jesu aa ziga byo maseswa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mat 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Jesu kale ga zwa mu munzi gwa Kapenauma no ku ja kwilonga lya Judeya, ku buzwe-juba bo Lwizi lwa Joodani. No ao kame, a bantu a bangi kale ba keza ku mu bunganina mi ko bu ka sholelele kale ga ba ziga.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />A Bafalisi bamwinya kale ba keza kwa Jesu keza ku mu jeleka ko ku mu buza nabo, “Ku ja ko mulao, buti ncintu ci botete unkosi aa lukulula u mukazi gwakwe?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Jesu kale ga ba taba ko ku ba buza ibuzi nage, “A ntaba jo ku lukulula u mukazi, Mushe mbuti sa co mu mulao?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Kale ba mu taba nabo, “Mushe sa zuminina buti, unkosi a li botele uku ñola iñolo no ku li tambika mukazi gwakwe no ku mu ta buti a jende kwabo.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:1">Mulao 24:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Kono Jesu kale ga ba taba nage, “Mushe sa ñola gogu u mulao kebaka lyo bukukutu bo myojo jenu. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Kono ku matatikilo go ku bumbigwa ko bintu byonse, Nyambe ‘sa bumba unkosi no mwanakazi.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Matatikilo 1:27</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 5:2">5:2</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />‘Ceci nceco ci toloka buti, unkosi kuti na zwe kwesi no nyina no ka joja no mukazi gwakwe, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />mi bo bile bulyao se ba la ba u muntu genke.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Matatikilo 2:24</ref>.</char></note> Kakuli ta ba si li bantu bo bile kono se muntu genke. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Cwale i bintu na ga gwanika Nyambe, u muntu a leke ku bi taa.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Jesu aa se ka kele mu njugo no bazigigwa bakwe, nabo kale ba mu buza a ntaba jo ku lukulula u mukazi. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Kale ga ba taba nage, “Uju a lukulula mukazi gwakwe no ku sesa u mungi kale ga tenda i cise. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Mi ati u mukazi na kana unkosi gwakwe no ka sesegwa ku nkosi u mungi, nage kale ga tenda i cise.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa wa a banuke-gana imfwijaguzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Ijuba limwinya, a bazazi bamwinya kale ba leta banabo kwa Jesu buti aba we imfwijaguzi. Kono a bazigigwa ba Jesu kale ba ba binda buti ba leke uku tembeka Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Jesu aa bona ibi ka bi tendaala, kale ga nyegelela a bazigigwa bakwe no ku ba ta nage, “Mu leke a banuke-gana ba keze kwangu, mi mu leke ku ba binda. Kakuli u mubuso gwa Nyambe ngwa bantu bo ku koza sinagwe mba baba a banuke-gana. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila buti, u muntu gense uju ta tambuli u mubuso gwa Nyambe sinagwe mwanuke-gana, ta na nginemo.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Cwale Jesu kale ga inda a banuke-gana no ku ba tula a maganja a mitwi, mi kale ga ba wa imfwijaguzi.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unkosana ka kwesi u lubono u lungi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Jesu aa ka ja ku munzi gwa Jelusalema, unkosana ka kwesi u lubono kale ga mu tigilila, no ka tongama afuwi nage mi kale ga mu buza nage, “Gwe muzigi u mulotu, ncinzi ndi botele uku tenda buti ndi jobole u bumi ta bu mani?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Jesu kale ga mu buza nage, “Ncinzi aa u ndi kuga buti ndi li mulotu, to zekelele buti Nyambe genke nde mulotu? <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />U li zi i milao iji ji ta buti, ‘U leke uku yaga, u leke uku tenda i cise, u leke uku iba, u leke uku pakanga byo manya, u leke uku omenenanga bamwinya, u kutike isho no nyoko.’ <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Lujendo 20:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Mulao 5:16-20</ref>.</char></note> ”<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Jojo nkosana kale ga taba nage, “Muzigi, jonse jejo i milao ndi li ji kutikite ku zwa bulyo ku bwanuke bwangu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Jesu kale ga mu lola, mi kale ga mu shaka. Kale ga mu ta nage, “U si bulite i cintu conke. U jende u ka gulise u lubono lwako igwe u we a masheleñi ku bampale. Nko kuti no ka gwane u lubono u lulotu kwigulu, igwe u keze u ndi umpilile.”<verse eid="MRK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Aobulyo jojo unkosana, kale ga suwa u mojo mi kale ga bogola bu tompete, kakuli ka kwesi lwini u lubono.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Jesu kale ga lolisa a bazigigwa bakwe no ku ta nage, “Ta li ncintu i citole ku muntu a kwesi u lubono uku ngina mu mubuso gwa Nyambe!”<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />A bazigigwa ba Jesu kale ba komokwa ko majwi gakwe. Kono Jesu kale ga ta kame nage, “Banangu, mbukababu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gamwinya a mabibele kame ga nungako koku ku majwi buti, “ku bantu ba sepete u lubono.”</char></note> uku ngina mu mubuso gwa Nyambe! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />U butole ni nkamele aa ji itila mu linsho lyo nsonga, ku ita u muntu a kwesi u lubono uku ngina mu mubuso gwa Nyambe.”<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />A bazigigwa ba Jesu kale ba komokwa lwini kame mi kale ba li buzagula nabo, “Elu ndini na jojeswe?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Jesu kale ga ba lola no ku ba ta nage, “Ku bantu ta bi golaali, kono kwa Nyambe i bintu byonse bi la golaala.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Pitolosi kale ga mu ta nage, “Iswe na twa leka i bintu byonse no ku ku umpilila.”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila buti, takuli u muntu uju na ga leka u munzi gwakwe, bakulwe no bancegwe no bancii jakwe, nyina nesi mane no bane kebaka lyangu, mane no majwi gangu a malotu, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />uju na kangwe uku tambula i bintu byo makumi ge kumi mo muno mu bumi bwa ansi byo ku koza sinagwe majugo, bakulwe no bancegwe, bancii jakwe, nyina, bane, u lugwa mane no ku penga, mi jojo u muntu kuti na ka gwane u bumi ta bu mani. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Kakuli a bantu a bangi aba ba li betanzi kuti na ba be bo mamaninino, mi bo mamaninino kuti na ba be betanzi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa gamba byo lufu lwakwe lya tatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Jesu no bazigigwa bakwe aa ka ba jenda mu nzila ji ja ku munzi gwa Jelusalema, Jesu ka tangilile, mi a bazigigwa bakwe na ba mu umpilile bu komoketwe, mi a bantu aba ka ba jenda mwishule, ka ba jenda bu li kalililwe. Jesu kame kale ga inda a bazigigwa bakwe be kumi no bo bile no ku ja nabo kumbali no ka ba gambaguza i bintu ibi na bi ka tendaale kwakwe. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Jesu kale ga ta a bazigigwa bakwe nage, “Mu tegeleze, se tu la ja ku munzi gwa Jelusalema, mi ime nde Mwana Muntu kuti na ndi ka legezigwe no ku wegwa mu nguzu jo mapulisiti a bakulu no bazigi bo mulao. Mi kuti na ba ndi atwile u lufu, no ku ndi wa mu nguzu jo bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Kuti na ba ndi sendagule, na ba ndi suwagile a mate, na ba ndi shape no ndupwa mane na ba ndi yage, kono aa na ku ite a majuba go tatwe kuti na ndi buke ku zwa ku bafu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa ziga byo ku sebeleza bamwinya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mat 20:20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Cwale Jakobo no Joani bana ba Zebedeya kale ba keza kwa Jesu, keza ku gamba nage nabo, “Muzigi, kame tu shaka buti u tu tendele ibi sa ka tu kumbile.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Jesu kale ga ba buza nage, “Mbinzi mu shaka buti na ndi mi tendele nenja?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Abo kale ba taba nabo, “Sa ka no kale mu cikalo co bumfumu co mpazimo no ku kala mu cibaka ci kutekea, twa sa shaka buti na tu kale afuwi negwe jumwinya ku mulyo gweganja lyako jumwinya ku monsho.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Ta mwizi ibi mu kumbila! Izo mu la gola uku zumina uku ngina mu mapenzi a makababu aga ga ndi kezela? Izo mu la gola uku pengela izina lyangu mane no ka fwa neme sinagwe muntu a kolobezigwa?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Kale ba mu taba nabo, “Ee, tu la gola!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Kuti na mu ngine mu mapenzi a makababu no ku fwa sinagwe ubu na ndi fwile. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Inguzu jo ku zuminina uju na ka kale ku mulyo gweganja lyangu kampa ku monsho, ta na nda ji wegwa. Ndi Nyambe bulyo e zi aba na ga lukiseza bulyao.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />A bazigigwa bamwinya be kumi, aa ba shugwa ibi na ba kumbila ba Jakobo no Joani, kale ba ba nyegelela. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Aobulyo Jesu kale ga ba gwanika no ku ba ta buti, “Mu li zekelele buti a bajendesi bo malonga ba la jendesa a bantu ko nguzu jo bujendesi. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Kono inwe mu leke ku tenda bulyao. Uju a shaka uku ba u mujendesi mukati kenu a be sinagwe muika, <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />uju a shaka uku ba u mujendesi a be u muika go bantu bonse. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Kakuli nanga ndime nde Mwana Muntu ta na nda keza ku ku sebelezwa, kono buti ndi sebeleze a bantu no ku wa u bumi bwangu ko ku ba intifo jo ku lukulula a bantu a bangi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa oza u muofu ka kugigwa Bbatimeya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Kale ba sika mu munzi gwa Jeliko, mi Jesu no bazigigwa bakwe aa se ka ba zwa mu munzi gwa Jeliko, a bantu a bangi kale ba ba umpilila. Unkosi uju ka li muofu gwezina lya Bbatimeya, (mwana Timeya) ka li nkumbizi mi nku mbali ne nzila ka kele. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Aa shugwa buti ndi Jesu gwa mu munzi gwa Nanzaleta a ita, kale ga tatika uku kugiliza nage, “Jesu, mwana Deviti, u ndi fwile inse!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />A bantu a bangi kale ba mu jukukila buti a ombelele. Kono ige kale ga kugiliza lwini nage, “Mwana Deviti, u ndi fwile inse!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Jesu aa shugwa bulyao, kale ga zimana no ku ta a bantu buti ba mu kuge. Abo kale ba mu kuga nabo, “U li gongoze, u keze kuno ndigwe a kuga.” <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Bbatimeya kale ga showela u mwabi gwakwe kumbali mi kale ga zimana wangu no ku ja kwa Jesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Jesu kale ga mu buza nage, “Ncinzi u shaka buti ndi ku tendele?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">Bbatimeya kale ga mu taba nage, “Muzigi, nda sa shaka buti ndi bone kame.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “U jende, kakuli inzumino jako ji la ku ozi.” Aobulyo Bbatimeya kale ga bona, mi kale ga umpilila Jesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Jesu aa ngina mu munzi gwa <optbreak />Jelusalema ko bumfumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Joa 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Jesu no bazigigwa bakwe aa se ka ba kokelele u munzi gwa Jelusalema, kale ba ita mu minzi ja Bbetifage no Bbetaniya, iji ka ji jakilwe kumbali Jelundu lya Olive. Jesu kale ga tuma a bazigigwa bo bile. <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />Kale ga ba ta nage, “Mu je mwa go gulya u munzi, mi aa sa ka mu ka nginemo kuti mu ka gwane a kambongolo ka sungililwe aka ka ka sini uku tendigwa impeleswa. Mu ka ka sungulule no ka ka leta ko kuno. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Ati nkwali uju sa ka mi buze buti, ‘Ncinzi aa mu tenda bulyao?’ Mu mu tabe buti, ‘Nu Mfumu a ka shaka mi kuti tu ka ka bogoze wangu.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Babo a bazigigwa na ba tumigwa, kale ba ka gwana a kambongolo ka sungililwe ambali no cizi. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Aa ka ba kwesi uku ka sungulula, a bantu aba ka ba zimene afuwi kale ba ba buza nabo, “Ncinzi mu sungulwila kako a kambongolo?” <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Kale ba ba taba ku ja ko bu na ga ba tela Jesu, mi kale ba ba zuminina uku ka inda. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Aa ba ka leta a kambongolo kwa Jesu, kale ba jala i bizwato byabo a mushana gwako mi Jesu kale ga kalao. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />A bantu a bangi kale ba jala i bijabalo byabo munzila, mi bamwinya kale ba jala a malali aga na ba tema mu lugwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />A ba ka ba tangilile na ba ka ba sigalile kale ba tatika uku kumbagana nabo,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 11:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">“Ku lumbigwe Nyambe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 11:9">Imfwijaguzi njakwe uju a keza mwizina lyo Mfumu!<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25-26">Nimbo 118:25-26</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Imfwijaguzi ji be ku mubuso ugu gu keza <optbreak />gwa sukuzetu Deviti!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">Ku lumbigwe Nyambe no mwigulu lyonse!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Jesu kale ga ngina mu munzi gwa Jelusalema mi kale ga jililila bulyo mu tumpetu to tempele.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I tempele ni njugo inene ja Nyambe iji ka ji gwanaala bulyo mu munzi gwa Jelusalema u mu ka ba lapelelanga a Maisilaele. Ka ba zuminanga buti Nyambe mwali momo mu njugo.</char></note> Aa sa la lolisisi nenja i bintu byonse, kale ga zwamo mi kakuli se ka ku li matengu kale ga bogola ku munzi gwa Bbetaniya no bazigigwa bakwe be kumi no bo bile.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa kuta i cishamu co mulya-nshwi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Mat 21:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />A masiku-siku ge juba na lya nungako, aa se ka ba zwa mu munzi gwa Bbetaniya, Jesu kale ga shugwa injala. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Kale ga bona i cishamu co mulya-nshwi u kule no nzila, ici ka ci kwesi lwini a mani mi kale ga gaja buti ci li kwesi i biyango. Kale ga ci jila buti a ka bone ati nko bi li i biyango. Aa ka sikako, kale ga gwana takuli mbwita a mani bulyo, kakuli ta ka ji li inako jo biyango. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Jesu kale ga ta ceco i cishamu nage, “No leke uku aka kame!” A bazigigwa bakwe kale ba mu shugwa na ta bulyao.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa mwaga-mwaga i bigulisantu mu tempele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Joa 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Jesu no bazigigwa bakwe aa ba sika mu munzi gwa Jelusalema, kale ga ngina mu tumpetu to tempele no ku tatika uku tandila kunze a bantu aba ka ba gula na ba ka ba gulisa. Kale ga gwisa-gwisa a matafule ga ba ka ba cinca a masheleñi no bikalo bya ba ka ba gulisa u tunkwilimba. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Kale ga binda bonse aba ka ba zolite u tumpetu to tempele i cibaka co magulikizo. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Mbuti ku ñolelwe buti, ‘Injugo jangu kuti na ji kugigwe buti ni njugo jo malapelelo go malonga gonse,’ kono inwe se mu li ji zolite a malibiko go basa.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isaya 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Jelemiya 7:11</ref>.</char></note> <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus clears out the Temple" file="lb00316b.jpg" size="col" loc="Mrk 11:15-18" ref="11:15-18">Jesu aa mwaga-mwaga a bagulisi mu Tempele</figure><verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />A Mapulisiti a bakulu no bazigi bo mulao aa ba shugwa ibi na ga tenda Jesu, kale ba tatika uku gaja bo ku mu yagila kono ka ba jogete kakuli a bantu a bangi ka ba komokiswa ku bintu ka ziga.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />A matengu ga lelyo ijuba, Jesu no bazigigwa bakwe kale ba zwa momo mu munzi.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />A masiku-siku kale ba itila kumbali no cishamu co mulya-nshwi ici na ga kuta Jesu, a bazigigwa kale ba bona buti se ci li jumite mane no miisi jonse. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Pitolosi kale ga vuluka a majwi ga Jesu aga na ga gambila ceco i cishamu co mulya-nshwi. Kale ga ta Jesu nage, “Muzigi, ngo lole! I cishamu so kuta se ci li jumite!”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Jesu kale ga ta a bazigigwa bakwe nage, “Mu zumine kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila buti mu la gola uku ta leli ilundu buti ‘U zwe ao u ka gwile mwiwate,’ mi kwa sa tendaala bulyao aa mu zumina. Kono aa mu mamanya mu myojo jenu, ta ku tendaali bulyao. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Mi i bintu byonse mu kumbila aa mu lapela, mu zumine buti mu la bi tambuli mi kuti na bi be byenu. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Mi aa mu lapela, mu kwatile u muntu gense uju a mi tulile i citela, buti Isenu gwa kwigulu a mi kwatile nenwe i bitendantu i bimangoju byenu. <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Kono ati ta mu kwatili bamwinya, ne Senu Nyambe ta na mi kwatile i bitendantu i bimangoju byenu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabuka go Cigelike gamwinya no mabuka gamwinya ta ga kwesi intimana ja 26.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Byo nguzu ja Jesu uku ka ji zwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Kale ba ngina mu munzi gwa Jelusalema kame, mi Jesu aa ka kwesi uku jenda-jenda mu tumpetu to tempele, a Mapulisiti a bakulu, no bazigi bo mulao mane no bajendesi kale ba keza kwakwe. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Kale ba mu buza nabo, “Ndini sa ku wa inguzu jo ku tenda i bintu ibi u tenda? Ndini na ga ji ku wa?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Jesu kale ga ba taba nage, “Kuti ndi mi buze ibuzi lyonke. Mu ndi tabe, mi kuti ndi mi lugwile buti nka nguzu jani ndi tenda byebi i bintu. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Inguzu ka litusisa Joani jo ku kolobeza nkwa Nyambe ka ji zwa kampa nku bantu? Mu ndi tabe!”<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Kale ba li gambaguza mwalyabo nabo, “Aa sa ka tu mu tabe buti nkwa Nyambe ka ji zwa, a mane ku tu buza buti, ‘Ncinzi aa ta na mwa mu zumina Joani?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Kampa aa sa ka tu mu tabe buti, ‘Nku bantu ka ji zwa!’ ” (Se ka ba jogete a bantu uku mu taba bulyao, kakuli a bantu bonse ka ba zumina buti Joani ka li muboni gwa Nyambe.)<verse eid="MRK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Kale ba mu taba nabo, “Ta tu zekelele.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Neme ta ndi mi lugwile uku ji zwa inguzu ndi litusisa mu ku tenda byebi i bintu.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Inguli jo balimi a babi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Jesu kale ga tatika uku gambagula nabo ko ku litusisa a manguli nage, “U muntu jumwinya sa lima igwa lya veine. Mi kale ga sa ilambo lyo ku kabila u lukau no ku jaka i tawala o ku lindila mi kale ga leka lelyo igwa ku balimi bamwinya buti ba limangemo na ba mu wa cimwinya mi kale ga ja mu lujendo. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />A nako jo ku zimbula, u mwini gwa kale ga tuma u muika ku bauneli buti aka mu indile ku lukau. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Kono a bauneli kale ba kwata jojo u muika no ku mu kaba no ku mu bogoza bulyo uku ta indite cimwinya. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Kame jojo mwinigwa, kale ga tumako u muika jumwinya. Kono nage kale ba ka mu kaba no ku mu kubaza ku mutwi, no ku mu sendagula lwini. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Kale ga tuma jumwinya, kono ige kale ba mu yaga. Kale ga tuma bamwinya a bangi, mi bamwinya kale ba kabigwa, bamwinya kale ba yagigwa.<verse eid="MRK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />“Mi se ka ku sigalile mwane genke go muninzana bulyo uju ka shaka. Kale ga mu tuma na gaja buti, ‘Wawa ige kuti na ba ka mu kutike.’<verse eid="MRK 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />“Kono a bauneli kale ba li gambaguza mwalyabo nabo, ‘Uju nde mujoboli, ndokweni tu mu yage buti tu jobole igwa!’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Aobulyo kale ba mu kwata no ku mu yaga no ku showela i citupu cakwe kunze jegwa.”<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Jesu kale ga ba buza nage, “Mbuti mu gajila, ubu ka tendela jojo u mwinigwa? Nda sa mi lugwila jojo u mwinigwa ka mana keza ku yaga babo a bauneli bonse no ku tulamo a bauneli a bangi. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Ka mu sini uku bala mu Mañolo u mu ku ñoletwe buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 12:10" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">‘Ibwe na mwa kana mwe bajaki, no ku li showa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">ndebwe na lya ba lyo nsumpo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibwe ndya ku koza sinagwe ncishamu co ku sumpisa injugo. Kakuli a majugo getu no bishamu tu ga sumpisanga ta li mabwe.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Nu Mfumu bulyo sa bi tenda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">mi mbintu bi komokwisa uku bi bona.’ ”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Nimbo 118:22-23</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />A bajendesi a bakulu kale ba shaka uku shumina Jesu kakuli na ba ziba buti aa ka gamba jejo inguli mbabo ka ta. Kono kale ba joga kebaka lyo bantu a bangi, mi kale ba mu leka na ba ka li jila.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Byo ku tenteka kwa Sesale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Aa na kwa mana byebyo, a bajendesi kale ba tuma a Bafalisi bamwinya no batusi ba Eloda, buti ba ka gwanine Jesu u mulandu ko ku mu ambika i bintu buti ba mu shumine. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Kale ba mu ta nabo, “Muzigi, tu li zekelele buti u li muntu a sepaala. To ungululwa ku bantu, mi to azi ku mushalo, kono gwa sa ziga inzila ja Nyambe ku jendelela no niti. Cwale tu lugwile, ku li botelwe uku tenteka u mutenteko kwa Sesale kampa ta ku botele? <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Tu tentekange kampa tu leke uku tentekanga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:15">Jesu kale ga ziba a mantu gabo mi kale ga ba ta nage, “Ncinzi aa mu ndi jeleka sinagwe ni ntezo mu ndi tega? Mu ndi sunde isheleñi lyo buwaya-waya.” <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Kale ba mu tambika isheleñi, mi Jesu kale ga ba buza nage, “I cifateo ne zina bi li aa mbyani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Kale ba taba nabo, “Mbya Sesale.”<figure style="fig" alt="Denarius coin" file="hk00166b.jpg" size="col" loc="Mrk 12:13-17" ref="12:13-17">Isheleñi lyo buwaya-waya</figure><verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Cwale Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Mu we Sesale ibi bi botele Sesale mi mu we Nyambe ibi bi botele Nyambe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Kale ba komokwa wawa ko mutabilo gwakwe.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Byo mbuko jo bafu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />A Basaduki aba ka ba zumina buti takuli imbuko jo bafu, kale ba keza kwa Jesu no keza ku mu buza nabo, <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Muzigi, Mushe sa tu ñolela u mulao ugu gu ta buti unkosi aa fwa ku leka u mukazi uku ta la mu lekeli a bana, mwancegwe gwa jojo unkosi a li botele uku sesa jojo umfwilwa buti a gwanineko mukulwe bana. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Cwale nko ka ba li a bankosi ba 7 be vumo lyonke. Nkulu jabo kale ga sesa u mukazi kono kale ga fwa ku leka jojo mukazi uku ta kwesi a bana. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Uju a mu umpa kale ga sesa jojo umfwilwa kono nage kale ga fwa uku ta la gwani a bana kwa jojo umfwilwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Kale kwa tendaala bulyao mane bonse ba 7 na ba fwa bulyao uku ta ba la gwaniko a bana. Ku mamaninino nage u mwanakazi kale ga fwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Cwale ngo tu lugwile, a mbuko jo bafu ndini na ka mu sese, ati bonse ba 7 se ba mu sesa?”<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Mu li fosete kakuli ta mu zekelele a Mañolo no nguzu ja Nyambe. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Kakuli a bafu aa na ba buke, ta na ba sese no ku sesigwa. Kuti na ba koze sinagwe mañiloi mwigulu. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />A ntaba jo mbuko jo bafu, ta na mwa bala mwibuka lya Mushe ubu sa mu tela Nyambe mu civuna ca mu mangusu ici na ga gwana ci jakila? Se ka ku itite i myaka i mingi Abbulaama no Isaka no Jakobo na ba la fwi. Nyambe kale ga ta Mushe nage, ‘Ndime Nyambe gwa Abbulaama no Isaka no Jakobo.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Lujendo 3:6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Cwale Nyambe ta li ndi Nyambe go bafu kono ngwa bantu ba joja. Ao mpaa mu fosete lwini.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">U mulao u munene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mat 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Jumwinya go bazigi bo mulao uju ka tegeleze i bintu ka ba li kanana, kale ga bona buti Jesu a la ba tabi nenja. Kale ga buza Jesu nage, “Ku milao jonse, ngwibo u mulao u munene ku ita jonse?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Jesu kale ga mu taba nage, “U mulao u munene ngu gogu, ‘Tegeleza Isilaele! Mfumwetu Nyambe, nde Nyambe genke bulyo. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />U shake Nyambe Mfumo ko mojo gwako gonse, no ko moya gwako gonse no ko ngana jako jonse mane no ko nguzu jako jonse.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:4">Mulao 6:4</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 6:5">5</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />U mulao gwa bili ngu gogu, ‘U shake uju bambene nage sinagwe ubu u li shakila gwemwini.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Livitike 19:18</ref>.</char></note> Takuli kame u mulao u munene ku zwa kwa jeji.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Jojo u muzigi go mulao kale ga ta nage, “Muzigi mbobo, u la gambi nenja aa u la ti buti, Nyambe ndege genke bulyo mi takuli jumwinya kame. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Mi ndi li zi buti i cintu i cinene nku mu shaka ko mojo gwangu gonse, no nshugwiliso jangu jonse no nguzu jangu jonse mane no ku shaka uju ndi bambene nage sinagwe ubu ndi li shakila. Bobu mbo buntu-awa ku ita uku wa Nyambe i bitagilo i bingi byo ku tentela a lutala no bitagilo bi shakaala mu mulao.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Jesu aa bona buti a la tabi nenja ko magano, kale ga mu ta nage, “To ka li kule no mubuso gwa Nyambe.” Mi ku zwao, takuli u muntu na ga mu buza cimwinya kame.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilesite ndi mwanani?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Jesu aa ka kwesi uku ziga a bantu mu tumpetu to tempele, kale ga ba buza nage, “Ncinzi a bazigi bo mulao aa ba ta buti u Mushaligwa ndi mwana Deviti? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Kakuli Deviti sa gamba ko nguzu jo Moya go Kucena buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 12:36" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">‘U Mfumu sa ta kwa Mfumwangu nage,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">U ndi kale ku lubazu lo mulyo gwangu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">Ku twala aa na ndi tulile aba ba ku zimbite</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">buti u ba jendese.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Nimbo 110:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />“Ko ku ta buti Deviti sa mu kuga buti, ndi mfumwangu, u Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe, mbuti ka golela uku ba mwane?” A bantu bonse kale ba tegeleza kwa Jesu bu jangele lwini.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Aa ka ziga bulyao, Jesu kale ga ta nage, “Mu nangule a bazigi bo mulao! Mba ku shaka lwini uku jenda-jenda bu jabele i mikanjo no ku shaka uku zuminizwa mwikute aa ba ita mu bibaka byo magulikizo. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Mba ku shaka lwini uku li shalila i bikalo bi kutekea mu majugo go malapelelo go Majuda mane no mu mikiti. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Mba ku gola lwini uku omenena a banakazi bo bamfwilwa ko ku ba ibila u lubono lwabo lwa mu majugo ko ku ba lapelela a matapelo a male jebo manya. Ko ku tenda bulyao, kuti na ba bangisigwe wawa.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Impo jo mwanakazi go mfwilwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luk 21:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Jesu mu tempele kame ka kalile ambali no citundu u mu ka ba tula i bintu ka ba wa ku tempele, na lolelele a bantu ubu ka ba wela a masheleñi. A bantu a bangi aba ka ba kwesi u lubono ka ba tulamo a masheleñi a mangi. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Kale kwa keza u mwanakazi go mfwilwa no ku shonjelamo u tusheleñi u tununu to bile to buwaya-waya.<verse eid="MRK 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Jesu kale ga kuga a bazigigwa bakwe no ku ba ta buti, “Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila buti, joju u mwanakazi go mfwilwa a la tuli i bintu i bingi momu mu citundu ku ita bonse aba ba kwesi uku tulamo. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Kakuli bonse kame ba tula u tuce u tu ba inda a bintu i bingi ibi ba kwesi kono joju u mwanakazi mu bumpale bwakwe a la wi u tuntu tonse aa ka botele uku jojela.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Jesu aa gambagula byo majuba go mamaninino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Jesu aa ka zwa mu tempele, jumwinya go bazigigwa bakwe kale ga ta nage, “Muzigi, ngo lole u bulotu bwa gaga a majugo mane no mabwe aga na ba jakisa a mamota!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “Ee, gaga a majugo a manene gonse u wene kuti na ga jonauke, buti takuli nanga ndibwe lyonke na li sigale bu kumbi kwa limwinya!”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Ku zwao Jesu kale ga ka kala Elundu lya Olive ili ka li bambene no tempele. Pitolosi, Jakobo Joani no Andileya, kale ba keza kwa Jesu mu buzinda no ku mu buza nabo, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Tu lugwile, ndusiku nzi na bi tendaale ibi u le ku gamba? Ncijuliko ca buti na ci tu sunde buti i bintu u le ku gamba se bi la vumbilizwa?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Jesu kale ga ba taba nage, “Mu leke uku zumina u muntu uku mi ungulula, <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Kakuli a bantu a bangi kuti na ba keze kezina lyangu, na ba li ta buti, ‘Ndime mutumigwa.’ <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Kuti na mu shugwe byo nkondo mane no maluguzi go nkondo, kono na mu leke uku likalililwa. Ee, byebyo bi li botele uku tendaala kono ta bi juliki buti ngo mamaninino. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />A bantu belonga limwinya kuti na ba lwe no bantu belonga limwinya. Mi u mubuso gumwinya kuti na gu li lwise no mubuso gumwinya. Kuti na ku bange no ku ukutanga kweevu mu bibaka i bingi byelonga, mane no njala inene bulyao. Kono byebyo kuti na bi be byo matatikilo bulyo go mapenzi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabuka gamwinya ga sa nungako gogu u mugambilo, “Mi kuti na ku be no kushisha sinagwe nkushisha ko mwanakazi a shaka uku bona u mucece.” </char></note><verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />“Aa na bi tendaale byebyo, na mu ligunge! Kakuli kuti na ba mi twalange ku makuta, no ku mi kabilanga mu majugo go malapelelo go Majuda. A babusisi no bamfumu kuti na ba mi zekisange, kebaka lyo ku ta buti mu li bazigigwa bangu. Kono jejo ne nako na ji be jenu jo ku ba gambaguza byangu. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Kakuli a majwi a malotu ga li botele uku tandazigwa tanzila mu malonga gonse. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Kono aa mu shuminigwa no ku zekisigwa, mu leke uku li kalililwa tanzila bo ka tabila. Kono inwe na mu gambe bulyo ibi na mi lugwile Nyambe mwa jejo inako. Kakuli ta li ndinwe na mu gambange, kono Moya go Kucena.<verse eid="MRK 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />“A bantu be vumo lyonke kuti na ba li legeze mwalyabo buti ba li yagise. Isi gwa muntu kuti na legeze mwane wawa, mi a bana kuti na ba lwise a bazazi babo mane no ku ba yagisa. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Mi a bantu bonse kuti na ba mi zimbe kebaka lyo ku ta buti mu li baumpilili bangu. Kono uju na zundamine mane na ka sika ku mamaninino, ndege na jojeswe.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />“Ijuba li la keza aa na mu bone ‘u bumangoju bu jogisa’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:27">Daniele 9:27</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:31">11:31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12:11</ref>.</char></note> bu zimene aa ta bu botele uku ba.” (Gwe mubali u shugwilise!) “Cwale a bantu ba li mwilonga lya Judeya, ba li botele uku tigila ku malundu. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />U muntu a li a cituwa co njugo na leke ku sukao buti a ka ngine mu njugo no ka indamo i cintu. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Mi uju na gwanaale na li mwigwa na leke uku bogola ku munzi buti a ka inde u mwabi gwakwe. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />U bumpai mbwa banakazi a basumba mane no banakazi aba na ba gwanaale na ba nyonsa a bacece mwa gago a majuba. <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Mu lapele buti byebyo na bi leke ku tendaala a mweo. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Kakuli kuti na ku be no nkalilwa inene mwa gago a majuba, kakuli byebyo ta bya la tendaala ku zwa aa sa bumbila Nyambe ilonga. Mi no ku zwao ta na ku tendaale bulyao kame. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Mi u Mfumu Nyambe kali ta na la ga fuwimpisi gago a majuba, takuli nanga muntu genke ka anduka. Kono kebaka lyo bantu aba sa li shalila, na ga fuwimpisa gago a majuba.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />“Mi ati u muntu na mi ta nage, ‘Nga mu lole uju nde Kilesite!’ kampa ‘Julya!’ Na mu leke uku bi zumina. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Kakuli a bashaligwa bo manya no baboni bo manya kuti na ba beko aba na ba tende i bijuliko no bintu bi komokwisa buti ba ungulule no bantu na ga li shalila Nyambe ati ku la golaala. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Mu nangule kakuli ndi la mi nanguzi inako na ji sini ku sika.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa gambagula byo keza kwakwe kwabili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />“Mwa jejo inako, mu majuba go nkalilwa,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 13:24" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">‘Ijuba kuti na li zime</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:24">mi u kwezi kuti na ku kangwe uku wa ituba.<verse eid="MRK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Intungwezi kuti na ji gwe ku zwa kwigulu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:25">mi no bintu bya mwigulu kuti na bi ukuswe.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isaya 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 34:4">34:4</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Juwele 2:10</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />“Ku zwao, a bantu bonse kuti na ba bone Mwana Muntu a keza mu majoba ko nguzu inene no mpazimo. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Mi kuti na tume a mañiloi gakwe ku gwanika a bashaligwa bakwe mu mbazu jone jelonga ku zwa ku ncinko jelonga jimwinya ku twala ku ncinko jegulu.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />“Mu li zige cimwinya ku cishamu co mulya-nshwi. Mu si ci bona se ci tumpila a mani a maya, mu zibe buti imvumbi se ji lili afuwi. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Nenwe bulyao, aa na mu bi bone byebyo bi tendaala, na mu zibe buti inako jakwe jo ka bogola mpafuwi se ji li. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila buti, a bantu ba lo luno u luasi ta na ba mane uku na bi sini uku tendaala. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Igulu nelonga kuti na bi mane kono a majwi gangu ta na ga mane.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Takuli uju e zi ijuba no nako</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mat 24:36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />“Kono takuli uju e zi ijuba ne nako wawa, nanga mañiloi kwigulu kampa u Mwana. Tata bulyo genke ndege e zi. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Mu lindile no ku tonda kakuli ta mwizi i nako!<verse eid="MRK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />“Kuti na ku koze sinagwe muntu a la ji mu lujendo. Ga sa leka injugo jakwe no ku lekao a baika bakwe buti ba ji babalele. Ga sa wa u muika no muika u musebezi gu mu botele, mi sa la lugwila uju a botele uku tondelanga a cizi buti a mamele wawa.<verse eid="MRK 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />“Nenwe bulyao, mu tonde kakuli ta mwizi buti u mwini njugo ni nakonzi na sike, kampa matengu, kampa masiku kampa bunga ni nako jo ku tungula ko ba silukombwe kampa a maca-siku. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Nanga na keza mu ku sa mi lugwila, mu leke ku zumina buti a mi gwane na mu sukula. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />I bintu ndi mi lugwila, mbebyo ndi lugwila a bantu bonse buti, ‘Mu tonde!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Jesu aa li mu munzi gwa Bbetaniya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Joa 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Se ka ku sigalile bulyo a majuba go bile buti ku tendaale i Mpaseka no Mukiti go Binkwa Ta bi Umelwe. A mapulisiti a bakulu no bazigi bo mulao ka ba si shaka a kaito bo ku kwatila Jesu ko magano buti ba mu yage. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Kale ba zumininana buti a mukiti ta ku golaali kebaka lyo ku ta buti a bantu mane na ba buse inyungani.<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Momo mu nako Jesu mu munzi gwa Bbetaniya ka li mwilapa lyo nkosi ka kugigwa Simoni go cisenda. Aa ka kwesi uku lya, u mwanakazi jumwinya kale ga keza ne botela lya alabbasitela lyo mafuta ga tula lwini aga ta ga pesulitwe. Kale ga sobola ibotela no ku sintila a mafuta a mutwi gwa Jesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />A ba ka ba lio, kale ba nyegela mi kale ba gambagula mwalyabo nabo, “Ncinzi a jonagwila a mafuta go menzi ga tula bulyaa? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Na ga la gulisigwa a masheleñi aga a gola uku belekela u muntu mu mwaka mukatumbi, no ku inda a masheleñi ku wa a bampale.” Mi kale ba jukukila jojo u mwanakazi ko bushanshu.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Kono Jesu kale ga ta nage, “Mu mu leke, ncinzi aa mu mu tembeka a musebezi u munene ugu a la ndi tendeli? <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />A bampale kuti mu kalange nabo mu nako jonse mi kuti mu ba tusange mu nako jonse iji mu la shaki. Kono ime ta mu kalange neme mu nako jonse. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Joju u mwanakazi a la tendi ubu a golela ku ndi singilila icimo a mafuta go menzi, ku tendela ijuba lyo ku zikigwa kwangu nanga inako na ji sini ku sika. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila buti mwilonga lyonse u mu na ku tandazigwe gaga a majwi a malotu, i bintu a la tendi joju u mwanakazi kuti na bi sukululwe ku mu gajilangao.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judasi aa zumina uku legeza Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Aobulyo Judasi Isikaliota, jumwinya go bazigigwa be kumi no bo bile, kale ga ja ku mapulisiti a bakulu buti ba ka zuminininane ubu ka golela uku ba kwatisiza Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Abo kale ba jangala aa ba shugwa bulyao mi kale ba mu kuluwiza uku mu wa a masheleñi. Judasi kale ga shaka u mutendelo u mulotu ugu ka ba gaja uku mu kwata kago.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">U mulalilo go mamaninino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk 22:7-14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Joa 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Mwijuba lyetanzi lyo Mukiti go Binkwa Ta bi Umelwe, mwijuba ili ka ba yaganga aka ngu-gana ko Mpaseka, a bazigigwa ba Jesu kale ba mu buza nabo, “Nkwibo u shaka buti tu ka ku lukisizeko u mulalilo go Mpaseka?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Jesu kale ga tuma bo bile bo bazigigwa bakwe nage, “Mu je momu mu munzi mi kuti mu li shangane no nkosi uju ka indite a kazunga ko menzi. Mu mu umpilile bulyao mane na mu ka sika mwilapa u mu a ja. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Mu ka te u mwini njugo buti, ‘U Muzigi mbuti a co buti, kwibo ka li a kampetu mu njugo jako u mu sa ka ndi lile u mulalilo go Mpaseka no bazigigwa bangu.’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Kuti a mi twale no ka mi sunda injugo ji jakilwe egulu lyo njugo jakwe iji ji kwesi indandulu inene. Mu ka tendelemo byo ku lya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />A bazigigwa bo bile kale ba ngina momo mu munzi. I bintu kale bya ka tendaala sinagwe ubu ka bi gambagwila Jesu mi kale ba ka lukisizamo u mulalilo go Mpaseka.<figure style="fig" alt="The Passover Meal" file="lb00320b.jpg" size="span" loc="Mrk 14:12-20" ref="14:12-20">U mulalilo go Mpaseka</figure><verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />A matengu Jesu kale ga sika no bazigigwa bakwe be kumi no bo bile. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Aa se ka ba kele na ba lya, Jesu kale ga ta nage, “Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila buti, jumwinya gwenu uju a lya neme aano kuti a ndi legeze.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />A bazigigwa kale ba joga no ku li kalililwa, mi jumwinya no jumwinya ka mu buza buti, “Izo ndime?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Njumwinya gwenu mwe be kumi no bo bile, uju a lya mu kasuba neme. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Kono ime nde Mwana Muntu nda sa fwa sinagwe ubu ku ñolelwe byangu, kono u bumpai mbwa muntu uju a ndi legeza. Ngwansho kali ta na la zaligwi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Aa ka ba kwesi uku lya kale ga inda i cinkwa no ku litumela, mi kale ga ci komagula no ku wa a bazigigwa bakwe nage, “Mu inde, kakuli gogu mubili gwangu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Kale ga inda no nkomoki u mu kakuli waine mi kale ga litumela kwa Nyambe. Kale ga ba wa buti ba shutagulemo bonse. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Kale ga ba ta nage, “Gaga malowa gangu go nzumininano<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabuka gamwinya mbuti ku ñolelwe buti, “impya”.</char></note>, aga ga sintikila a bantu a bangi. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila buti, ta ndi si nywi waine kame mbwita mwijuba na ndi ka nywe waine u muya mu mubuso gwa Nyambe.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Aa se ba la mani, kale ba zimba u lwimbo mi kale ba ja Elundu lya Olive.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa ganuna buti Pitolosi kuti na mu shampule</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Joa 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Jesu kale ga ta a bazigigwa bakwe nage, “Mwense kuti mu joge no ku ndi mwagala, kakuli mbobo ku ñolelwe buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 14:27" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">‘Kuti na ndi kabe u mulisani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 14:27">mi ingu jakwe kuti na ji mwagale.’ <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Zakaliya 13:7</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />“Kono aa se ndi la buki ku zwa ku bafu, kuti na ndi li tangize ku ja kwilonga lya Galileya mi kuti na mu ka ndi gwaneko.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Pitolosi kale ga mu ta nage, “Nanga sa ka ba tige no ku mwagala bonse baba, ime ta ndi ku leke.”<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Jesu kale ga mu taba nage, “Mbyaconse ndi ku lugwila Pitolosi, ga gano a masiku wawa silukombwe na sini ku tungula lyabili, kuti u ndi shampule ko tatwe buti to ndi zi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Pitolosi kale ga kana nage, “Nanganceciba buti ndi li botele uku yagigwa negwe, ta na ndi ku shampule.” Mi a bazigigwa bamwinya bonse kale ba gamba bulyao nabo.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa lapela mwa Gesemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Kale ba ka sika mu cibaka ka ci kugigwa Gesemani, mi Jesu kale ga ta a bazigigwa bakwe nage, “Mu kale aano, aa ndi si ka lapela.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Kale ga inda Pitolosi no Jakobo no Joani no ka ja nabo, mi kale ga tatika uku zielea no ku li kalililwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Kale ga ba lugwila nage, “U mojo gwangu se gu li tompete mi se ndi li li mu nkalilwa mane sinagwe se ndi fwe bulyo. Mu sigale aano, mi mu tonde!”<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Aa sa la ba leki kace, kale ga gwila ansi mi kale ga lapela nage, “Kambe ncintu ci golaala, je jino inako jo kushisha ji ndi kezela, na ji ndi itilila.” <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Kale ga lapela nage, “Abba, Tata i bintu byonse kwako mbitole. U senekeze u kule je jino inako jo mapenzi. Nanganceciba, ku leke uku tendaala ubu ndi shakila kono ku tendaale bulyo ubu u shakila.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Kale ga bogola mi kale ga ka gwana a bazigigwa bakwe na ba sukula, kale ga ta Pitolosi nage, “Simoni, so la sukula? Igwe gwa sa kangwa uku tonda mu nako ince bulyo? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Mu tonde no ku lapela buti mu leke uku ngina mu mijeleko iji ji keza. U moya gu la shaka, kono u mubili ta gu kwesi inguzu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Jesu kale ga ba leka kame no ka lapela ubu na ga lapelela etanzi. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Aa ka bogola kale ga keza ku ba gwana ba sukula kame kakuli iñonzi se ka ji lemese a mensho gabo. Kale ba bula co ku gamba.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Aa sa la ka ba bogweli lya tatu kale ga ba gwana na ba sukula kame, mi kale ga ba ta nage, “Mu si lele no ku wisa? Nela! Inako jila siki mi ime nde Mwana Muntu se ndi la legezigwa no ku wegwa mu maganja go bantu bo bitendantu i bimangoju. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Mu zimane tu jende! Nga mu lole, uju a ndi legeza a la siki.”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa kwatigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Joa 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Jesu aa ka si gamba bulyao, kale kwa keza Judasi, jumwinya go bazigigwa be kumi no bo bile, na jenda no kagugi a kanene ko bantu aba ka ba indite u tufulo u tunene no bivuni, aba na ba ka tumigwa ku mapulisiti a bakulu, no bazigi bo mulao, mane no manduna.<verse eid="MRK 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Judasi u mulegezi sa ba wa i cijuliko ca buti, “Uju sa ka ndi ka sonsone ndege, mu mu kwate no ku mu shumina mu ka je nage mi mu mu mamele.” <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Aa ba ka sika, Judasi kale ga itilila bulyo kwa Jesu no ka mu ta buti, “Muzigi!” Mi kale ga mu sonsona. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Bamwinya ku bankosi aba ka jenda nabo Judasi kale ba kwata Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Jumwinya go bazigigwa ba Jesu uju ka zimene afuwi no Jesu kale ga shomona a kafulo a kanene no ku kajula u kutwi ko muika go mupulisiti u mukulu.<verse eid="MRK 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Jesu kale ga ba buza nage, “Ncinzi aa mu la kezi no tufulo u tunene no bivuni keza ku ndi kwata sinagwe ndi li cijoni? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Ka ndi kalanga nenwe a majuba a mangi na ndi ziga a bantu mu tumpetu to tempele mi ta mwa la ndi kwata, kono a mañolo ga li botele uku vumbilizwa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Aobulyo a bazigigwa bakwe kale ba joga mi kale ba andumuka ku mu leka genke. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Nko ka li unkosana uju ka ja bu umpilile Jesu na li lepwile isila bulyo. Kale ba mu aza-aza buti ba mu kwate nage mi kale ba mu baka kwi sila ili ka li lepwile, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />mi kale ga ba lekela lelyo isila mu maganja no ku tiga mu cinsense bulyo.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa twaligwa ku nkuta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mat 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22:54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Joa 18:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Kale ba twala Jesu kwilapa lyo mupulisiti u mukulu uku na ba gwananina a mapulisiti bonse a bakulu no manduna mane no bazigi bo mulao. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Pitolosi ka umpilile Jesu na jenda u kule, mane kale ga ka ngina no mwilapa lyo mupulisiti u mukulu. Momo kale ga ka kala no ka jota ku mulilo aa ka ba jota a bamameli.<verse eid="MRK 14:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Aobulyo a mapulisiti a bakulu no manduna bonse kale ba shaka u bupaki ubu ka bu botele uku gwanisa Jesu u mulandu gu botele u lufu, kono kale ba kangwa uku bu gwana. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />A bantu a bangi ka ba mu shangeza i bintu i bingi kono ta ka ba zumininana mu bupaki. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Bamwinya kale ba zimana no ku paka byo manya ku mu shangeza bulyo nabo, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Na twa mu shugwa na gamba buti, ‘Kuti na ndi jakulule jeji i tempele iji na ba jaka a bantu, mi mu majuba go tatwe kuti na ndi jake i tempele jimwinya iji ta na ji jakigwe ku bantu.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Kono no momo mu bupaki bwabo, kale ba yayana mi ta na ba zumininana.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />U mupulisiti u mukulu kale ga zimana mi kale ga buza Jesu nage, “Ncinzi aa to tabi ku li lamwina mu bintu byonse ibi ba ku ambika? Indi to shugwile ibi ba ku ta?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Kono Jesu kale ga ombelela bulyo, mi ta na ga taba cimwinya. U mupulisiti u mukulu kale ga mu buza kame nage, “Kuti ndigwe Mushaligwa, no Mwana Nyambe uju a kwesi imfwijaguzi?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Jesu kale ga mu taba nage, “Ndime. Mi kuti na mu bone Mwana Muntu a kele ku mulyo go nguzu je ganja lya Nyambe, na ndi keza bu kele a majoba ga kwigulu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />U mupulisiti u mukulu kale ga ñatula i bizwato byakwe mu bunyegezi, mi kale ga ta nage, “Mba cinzi a bampaki sa ka tu zunde kame? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Mu la shugwi mwense aa shwauza. Indi mbuti mu gajila?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Bonse kale ba atula nabo, “A li kwesi u mulandu mi a li botele uku yagigwa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Bamwinya kale ba tatika uku mu suwagila a mate, mane kale ba mu shumina isila ku mensho mi kale ba mu kaba no mafaindi. Kale ba mu ta buti, “Tunga tu bone, ati u li zi uju a la ku kabi!” Mi aba ka ba mu mamela kale ba mu kabagula nabo.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pitolosi aa shampula Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mat 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Joa 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Pitolosi aa ka li mwilapa lyo mupulisiti u mukulu, jumwinya go baika bo mupulisiti u mukulu go mukazana, kale ga nginamo. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Aa bona Pitolosi na jota u mulilo, kale ga mu lolisisa nenja mi kale ga mu ta nage, “Negwe ko kalanga no Jesu gwa kwa Nanzaleta.”<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Kono Pitolosi kale ga shampula nage, “Ta ndi zi mane ta ndi shugwilisi ibi u gamba.” Aa mana ku taba bulyao, kale ga zimana no ka zimana ambali no cizi ce lapa. Mi aobulyo silukombwe kale ga tungula.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:68 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabibele gamwinya ta ga nungi “mi silukombwe kale ga tungula.”</char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Jojo u mukazana aa mu bona na zimeneo, kale ga ta a bantu ka ba zimene ambali no Pitolosi buti, “No joju nkosi njumwinya gwabo.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Pitolosi kale ga shampula kame.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Aa se ku la iti inako ince, babo a bantu ka ba kele no Pitolosi kale ba mu ta nabo, “Ndiconse negwe u li jumwinya gwa baba a bantu, kakuli negwe u li Mugalileya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Pitolosi kale ga li konka mane no ku ba konka nabo mi kale ga ba ta nage, “Ta ndi mwizi joju unkosi mu gambagula byakwe.”<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Aobulyo silukombwe kale ga tungula lyabili. Pitolosi kale ga gaja ijwi na ga mu gambila Jesu buti, “Silukombwe na sini ku tungula lyabili kuti u ndi shampule ko tatwe.” Aobulyo Pitolosi kale ga lila.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Jesu aa twaligwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Joa 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />A masiku-siku, a mapulisiti a bakulu no manduna mane no bazigi bo mulao no bantu bonse bo nkuta, kale ba zumininana mi kale ba shumina Jesu no ku mu twala kwa Pilato, u mubusisi go Muloma.<verse eid="MRK 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilato kale ga buza Jesu nage, “Ndigwe Mfumu go Majuda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Jesu kale ga mu taba nage, “Bulyao u tela bulyo, ndime.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />A mapulisiti a bakulu kale ba mu shangeza i bintu i bingi. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Mi Pilato kale ga buza kame Jesu nage, “Ncinzi aa to tabi no shugwile i bintu byonse ibi ba ku shangeza?” <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Kono Jesu kale ga ombelela bulyo, mi Pilato kale ga komokwa.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Nko ka gu li u mulao go mubusisi go ku shumununanga u mupantiti genke mu mwaka mu mwaka, uju ba li kumbilila a bantu ku mu zwisa mu ntolongo a Mpaseka. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Mwa jejo inako mo ka li unkosi mu ntolongo uju ka kugigwa Bbalabbasi, uju sa yaga u muntu mu nkondo. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />A bantu kale ba keza kwa Pilato no ku mu kumbila buti a shumunune ipantiti ili sa ka ba mu kumbile ubu a tendelanga.<verse eid="MRK 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilato kale ga ba buza nage, “Mu la shaka buti ndi mi lukulwile joju u mfumu go Majuda?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Kakuli Pilato ke zi buti a mapulisiti a bakulu ka gu li muna bulyo ka ba fwila Jesu aa na ba mu shumina no ku mu leta kwakwe. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Kono a mapulisiti a bakulu kale ba shonga a bantu buti ba indikize Pilato uku shumununa Bbalabbasi ku leka Jesu.<verse eid="MRK 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilato kale ga ba buza nage, “Cwale mbuti mu shakila buti ndi tendele kwa joju mu kuga buti nu Mfumu go Majuda?”<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus before Pilate" file="cn01828b.jpg" size="col" loc="Mrk 15:9-15" ref="15:9-15">Jesu aa atuligwa kwa Pilato</figure><verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Bonse kale ba kumbagana nabo, “U mu kankamine a cifapaano!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilato kale ga ba buza nage, “Kebakanzi? Mulandunzi na ga fosa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">A bantu kale ba kumbagana lwini wawa nabo, “U mu kankamine a cifapaano!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilato ko ku shaka uku jangaza a bantu, kale ga ba lukulwila Bbalabbasi mi kale ga ta buti Jesu a shapigwe mi kale ga mu wa a masole bo Maloma buti ba ka mu kankamine a cifapaano.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">A masole aa ba nyungulula Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mat 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Joa 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />A masole kale ba inda Jesu no ku mu twala a nkanza jo mubusisi iji ka ji kugigwa izina lya Pulatoliyamu mi kale ba kugilao a masole bonse. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Kale ba jabika Jesu i cijabalo co mubala go nzilu no ku mu kagika ku mutwi u tutabi to miga u tu na ba zinga sinagwe nciusi co mfumu. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />A masole kale ba tatika uku mu shogelela nabo, “Oosho gwe Mfumu go Majuda!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Ka ba kwesi uku mu kabanga no lutaka a mutwi no ku mu suwagila a mate na ba tongamanga ansi na ba mu shogelela ko ku mu nyungulula. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Aa se ba la mani uku mu talula ubu ka ba golela, kale ba mu jabula i cijabalo co mubala go nzilu ici na ba mu jabika mi kale ba mu jabika i bizwato byakwe. Kale ba mu twala ku ku mu kankamina a cifapaano.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa kankaminwa a cifapaano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Joa 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Kale ba shangana unkosi gwezina lya Simoni uju ka zwa kwilonga lya Silene. A masole kale ba mu indikiza uku koleka i cifapaano. Simoni ndege ka li isi ba Alekizanda no Lufuzi, mi mbulyo ka li jendela momo mwilonga na ka li zwila kwabo. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Kale ba ka sikisa Jesu a cibaka ci kugigwa izina lya Gologota (ku toloka i “cibaka co katendele”). <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Kale ba mu wa waine go ku gwanika no cinywantu ci kugigwa i mila, kono Jesu kale ga kana uku mu nywa.<verse eid="MRK 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />A masole kale ba kankamina Jesu a cifapaano. Kale ba li taila i bizwato byakwe ko ku tenda iñeela, buti i cizwato no cizwato ci indigwe kwoju a ji tunga gense. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Se ka ji li inako ja 9 jo masiku-siku aa ba ka mu kankamina a cifapaano. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Kale ba ñola inzibiso jo mulandu ugu ka ba mu yagila e ala no ku ji kankamina egulu lyakwe aa ka ku ñoletwe buti, “<char style="sc">U Mfumu go Majuda</char>.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Kale ba kankamina no bantu bo bile bo bitendantu i bimangoju byo busa antu-onke no Jesu. Cimwinya ku lubazu lo mulyo gwakwe, cimwinya ku lubazu lo monsho gwakwe, <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />ku vumbiliza a Mañolo aga se ga ta buti, “Sa balilwa ukuntu konke no bantu bo bitendantu i bimangoju<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabuka go Cigelike gamwinya no mabuka gamwinya ta ga kwesi intimana ja 28.</char></note>.”<verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Aba ka ba ita bonse mu nzila ka ba mu nyungulula na ba ukusa i mitwi jabo nabo, “Oo! Mpaa ko tanga buti u la gola uku jakulula i tempele no ku ji jaka kame mu majuba go tatwe. <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />Suka a cifapaano, mi u li jojese!”<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />A mapulisiti a bakulu no bazigi bo mulao ka ba mu nyungulula nabo, “Ka jojesa a bantu a bangi kono ga sa kangwa uku li jojesa gemwini! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Mushaligwa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu mushobo go Cigelike ndi Kilesite mi mu mushobo go Ciebelu ndi Mesiya.</char></note> u Mfumu gwa Isilaele, suka a cifapaano buti tu bone mi tu zumine.” Mane no bankosi aba na ba kankaminwa antu-onke nage ka ba mu shwaaguza nabo.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa fwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Joa 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Inako ja 12 jo kamwi, ijuba kale lya zima mi kale kwa ba no kansindwe mwilonga lyonse ku twala ku nako jo ma 15. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Ko nako jo ma 15, Jesu kale ga kumba lwini nage, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabakitani?” ku tolokezo, “Nyambe gwangu, Nyambe gwangu, ncinzi aa u la ndi lekeleli?”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:1">Nimbo 22:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Bamwinya ku bantu ka ba zimene afuwi aa ba shugwa bulyao kale ba ta nabo, “Mu tegeleze, sa la kuga u muboni gwa Nyambe Eliya.” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Jumwinya kale ga tiga no ka cumpwika i ciponci mwa waine go ku lyelyeta no ku ci shupika ku lutaka. Kale ba ci wa Jesu buti a poleko. Mi kale ba ta nabo, “Ndokweni tu lolelele ati u muboni gwa Nyambe Eliya kuti a keze ku mu indao!”<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Aobulyo Jesu kale ga kumba mi kale ga lekelela u muuja gwakwe buti gu mane.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Isila lya mu tempele kale lya ñatuka ku tatikila kwigulu ku leta kwinsi. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />U mujendesi u mukulu go masole uju ka zimeneo na lolelele Jesu na fwa, kale ga ta nage, “Ndiconse joju unkosi ka li Mwana Nyambe!”<figure style="fig" alt="Temple curtain torn top to bottom" file="gt00041.jpg" size="col" loc="Mark 15: 33-41" ref="15:33-41">Isila lya mu Tempele kale lya ñatuka</figure><verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Mukati ko banakazi bamwinya aba ka ba zimeneo na ba lolelele, ibi ka bi tendaala, mpo ka li no Maliya Magadalena, no Maliya nyina ba Jakobo u mutompo no Josefa, mane no mwanakazi jumwinya uju ka kugigwa Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Baba mbo banakazi ka ba umpililanga Jesu no ku mu tusa mu bintu ibi ka shakanga na ba si li mwilonga lya Galileya. Mane no banakazi bamwinya a bangi aba na ba keza nage ku munzi gwa Jelusalema, mpo ka ba li nabo.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josefa aa tula i citupu ca Jesu mwibita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Joa 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Se ka ga li matengu ge juba lyo ku litukiseza insebelezo ja lyo Nsabata iji ka ji botele uku tatika a matengu ga lelyo ijuba, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Josefa gwa ku munzi gwa Alimateya, uju ka li jumwinya go manduna ba kutekea bo nkuta mi ka li muntu ka lindile uku keza ko mubuso gwa Nyambe. Kale ga ja kwa Pilato mi kale ga ka kumbila i citupu ca Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilato kale ga komokwa aa shugwa buti Jesu kale ga fwa. Kale ga kuga u mujendesi u mukulu go masole no ku mu buza bya Jesu ati ndiconse buti a la fwi. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Pilato aa sa la shugwi ku mujendesi go masole buti ndiconse Jesu a la fwi, kale ga zuminina Josefa buti aka angule i citupu a cifapaano. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Josefa kale ga ka gula isila inene lyo ku tuba mi kale ga angula i citupu ca Jesu a cifapaano no ku ci vungila mwisila no ka ci tula mwibita ili na lya conkomonwa mwibwe. Kale ga galumwina ibwe inene ku cizi ce lambo. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Maliya Magadalena no Maliya nyina ba Josefa kale ba bona u mu ka ba tula i citupu ca Jesu.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Jesu aa buka ku zwa ku bafu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Joa 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />A matengu gejuba lyo Nsabata,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">U bungi bo mabuka na ga litusisa ijwi lyo Ciebelu lyo “Nsabata” ku toloka ijuba lyo ku wisa.</char></note> Maliya Magadalena no Maliya nyina gwa Jakobo mane no mwanakazi jumwinya uju ka kugigwa Salome, kale ba ja no ka gula a mafuta go menzi aga ga nunka u bulotu buti na ba ka singe i citupu ca Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Lyo nsunda a masiku-siku, ijuba na li ñatula, kale ba ja kwibita. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Mu nzila kame kaba ja bu li buza nabo, “Ndini sa ka ka tu galumwine ibwe ku lituzwisikiza a manginino gebita?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Aa ba ka sika kale ba bona buti ibwe ili ka lili inene wawa, na lya galumunwa ku zwa a cizi cebita.<verse eid="MRK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Kale ba ngina mwibita mi kale ba bona unkosana ka zwesi u mukanjo go ku tuba na kele ku mulyo mi kale ba joga. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Jojo unkosana kale ga ba ta nage, “Mu leke uku joga, ndi Jesu gwa mu munzi gwa Nanzaleta mu shaka, uju sa kankaminwa a cifapaano. Ta mu li mo muno, a la buki ku zwa ku bafu. Nga mu lole u mu na ba mu tula. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Mu bogole mu ka lugwile a bazigigwa bakwe mane no Pitolosi, buti Jesu a la li tangizi uku ja mwilonga lya Galileya. Mu jeko kuti mu ka mu bone sinagwe ubu sa mi tela.”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Babo a banakazi kale ba zwa ebita bu tutuma no ku komokwa lwini mi kale ba kangwa uku ja bu lugwila a bantu kakuli ka ba jogete lwini.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabibele ge tanzi mpa Maleka 16:8 ka ga manina. Gamwinya a mabuka ga li kwesi a mamaninino ga andene-andene a mafuwi no male ga leli ibuka lya Maleka. U bungi bo mabuka ga sa tulilila a mamaninino gonse antu-onke a mafuwi no male gonse. </char></note><verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa li bonaaza kwa Maliya Magadalena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Joa 20:11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Jesu aa sa la buki ku zwa ku bafu a masiku-siku lyo nsunda, kale ga li bonaaza tanzi kwa Maliya Magadalena uju sa oza ko ku zwisa kwakwe a mayauma ga 7. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Maliya kale ga ka lugwila a bantu aba ka ba kalanga no Jesu aba ka ba sigwanene na ba si lila. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Aa se ba shugwa buti Jesu mumi, no ku ta buti Maliya Magadalena a la mu boni, kale ba kangwa uku zumina.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa li bonaaza ku bazigigwa bo bile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luk 24:13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Mwishule lya byebyo, Jesu kale ga li bonaaza mu mubonaalilo gumwinya ku bazigigwa bakwe bo bile aba ka jenda mu nzila na ba zwa mu munzi gwa Jelusalema. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Kale ba bogola no ka gambaguza bagenzabo, kono kale ba kangwa uku ba zumina nabo.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa li bonaaza ku bazigigwa be kumi no genke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Joa 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Bit 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Mwishule lya byebyo, Jesu kale ga li bonaaza ku bazigigwa be kumi no genke aa ka ba kwesi uku lya. Kale ga ba nyaza kebaka lyo ku bula inzumino kwabo no ku bula inshugwiliso mu ku kana uku zumina babo na mu bona uku sa la buki ku zwa ku bafu.<verse eid="MRK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Mi kale ga ba ta nage, “Mu je mwilonga lyonse mu ka tandaze a majwi a malotu ku bantu bonse. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />U muntu gense uju na zumine no ku kolobezigwa, kuti na jojeswe. Kono u muntu gense uju na kane uku zumina, kuti na atuligwe. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Aba na ba zumine, kuti na ba tende byebi i bijuliko; Kuti na ba tande a mayauma mwizina lyangu mi kuti na ba gambe mu ndimi impya. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Kuti na ba kwate a majoka, mi aa na ba nywe i cinywantu ci yaga, ta na ci ba tende u bukababu. Kuti na ba tule a maganja a balwele mi a balwele kuti na ba lwaluke.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa ja kwigulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luk 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Bit 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />U Mfumu Jesu aa sa la mani ku ba lagana bulyao, kale ga indilwa mwigulu no ka kala mu cibaka ci kutekea ku mulyo gweganja lya Nyambe. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Mi a bazigigwa kale ba ja mu bibaka i bingi na ba ja bu tandaza a majwi a malotu, mi u Mfumu Jesu ka sebeza no ku vumbiliza ko bijuliko ibi ka ba gamba.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>